<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Ezekiel</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezekiel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltan kum sawmthumna, kha lina, huai kha ni ngana ah Kebar lui a saltangte lak a ka omlai in hichi a honghi a, van a kihong a, Pathian kilakna ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai kha ni ngana ah, huai bel kumpipa Jehoiakin saltan kum ngana ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaldai gam a Kebar lui ah, Buzi tapa siampu Ezekiel kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung a; huai ah Toupa khut a tung ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan ka en a, ngai in, mallam a kipan huihpi thupi mahmah a hong kuan a, meipi a saha sah, kuang zoizoi, a kim tengteng tanvak puappuap asung mei laitak ah sikam bang a am a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in huailai a kipan in thilhing li kibatpih a hong pawtkhia ua, a kimuh dan uh hichibang ahi: mihing batna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mai li a neichiat ua, kha li a neichiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khete uh a tang ahi a; a khepek nuai lam uh bawngnou khepek bang ahi a; huan dalte mahmah bang in a vakkhe zualzual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pang lite ua a khanuai uah mihing khut bang a nei ua: huchi in a li un a mel uleh a khate uh hichibang in a pu uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A khate uh a kizom a; a pai un leng a kihei ngeikei ua, a mazawn uah a paichiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mel un a kibatpihte mihing mel bang ahi a, a li un a taklam pang uah humpinelkai mel a pu ua, a li un a veilam pang uah bawngtal mel a pu ua, a li un muvanlai mel a punawn ua, a mel uh huchibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan a khate uh a zakkhia ua, a kha nihte un a kizak zom chiat ua, nih in a pumpi uh a khuh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Malam ah a paichiat ua, kha paina lam ding ah a pai ua, a pai un leng a kihei ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilhingte lak ah suangkuangthei ampha bang, meisel bang mai a suk leh tou in a pai a; meibel a ampha mahmah a, mei a kipan khopi a hong suakkhe zualzual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thilhingte khophe zualzual bang in a vialtai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan thil hingte ka et lai in, ngai in, thil hingte zul ah a mel lite uh ading in lei ah kangtalai khe khat zel ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kangtalai khe leh a tatdan beril suang zia bang mai in a lang a, a li un latdan khat a nei ua, a latdan uh leh a tatdan uh kangtalai khe khat sung a kangtalai khe dang om bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pai chiang un sik li in a pai thei ua, a pai un leng a kihei ngeikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kangtalai khe kual sangtak leh mulkimhuaitak ahi a; a li un kual, mit a dim teptup a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in thilhingte a pai chiang un a zul uah kangtalai peite a paisam uhi: thil hingte lei a kipan dopkang a a om uleh kangtalai khete leng dopkang in a omsam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kha paina ding lam peuhmah ah a pai ua; huai lam ah kha a pai ding ahi hi; huchi in, kangtalai khete a zul uah dopkang in a om ua, thilhing kha kangtalai khete ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaite a pai chiang un hiaite a pai uhi: huaite adin chiang un hiaite ading ua: huaite lei a kipan a dopkang a a om chiang un kangtalai khete amau zul ah dopkang in a om ua, thilhingte kha kangtalai khete ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil hingte lu tung ah van kibatpih a om a, kristal vak bang a te mulkimhuai tak a lu tung uah a kiphalh zeizoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Van dum nuai ah a kha uh a kopkhat thil hing dangte sun in a zak ua, a kha uh kop khat nawn in a pumpi uh a khuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan a len uleh a kha ging uh tui tampi mahmah ging bang, bangkim hihtheipa aw bang mai, mipi ging vengvung husa, sepaihhon husa bang mai in ka za a; adin uleh a kha uh a kaisak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lu tung ua van dum tung ah aw a hongom a, adin uleh a kha uh a kaisak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan a lu tung ua van dum tung ah mangtutphah bang, sapphir suang bang mai a kimu a om a: huai mangtutphah bang tak tung ah mihing bang a kilang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A kawngchiang tunglam sik hal ap bang mai in ka mu a, a kawng hileh kilawm chiang nuailam mei bang mai hi in ka mu a, a vak kimvel lelaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vuahzuk ni a meipi tung a sakhituihup latdan bang in a kim vak a lang hi. Hiai Toupa thupina latdan bang ahi. Huan ka muh in a khup in ka puk a, thugenpa aw ka za hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, na khe in ding in, na kiang ah thu ka gen ding hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kiang a thu a genlai in kha kei ah a honglut a, ka khe in a hon dingsak a, huchi in kei hon houpihpa ka ngaikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, Israel tate kiang ah, helhat nam, ka tung a helnakte kiang ah k’on sawl hi: amau leh a pipute un leng hiai ni pha nangawn in ka tung ah a talek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suan paupeng leh genhakte ahi ua, a kiang uah nang k’on sawl hi; a kiang uah, “ Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi” na chi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in amau a ngaikhia uhiam, a ngaikhe kei uhiam, helhat a inkuan hi ua, a lak uah zawlnei a om chih a theigige ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang, mihing tapa, amaute kihta kenla, a thu uah leng lunglel sam ken, na kiang ah khaulingnei leh loulingneite om in, aikam lak a teng himah lechin: helhat mi himahle uh, a thu uh kihta kenla, a latdan uah leng lunglel sam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ngaikhia uhiam, a ngaikhe kei uhiam, a kiang uah ka thu na gen ding ahi: helhat inkuan ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh nang mihing tapa, na kiang a ka gen ngaikhia in; mi helhat inkuan bang in helhat kenla: na kam ka inla, ka honpiak ne in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan ka en a ngai in, khut in a honsawk a, ngai in huai ah laibuzial a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ma ah a phalh a, a sunglam leh a pawlam gelh ahi; kahna, lusunna leh tunggikna gelhna a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, na muh ne in; laibuzial ne inla, Israel inkawte kiang ah thu vagen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in ka kam ka ka a, laibuzial a hon nesakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah Mihing tapa, na gil ah pai inla, hiai laibuzial k’on piak in na gilsung hihdim in, a chi hi. Huchi in ka neta a, a khumdan ka kam ah khuaizu bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah: Mihing tapa kuan inla, Israel inkawte kiang ah ka thute zang in vagen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pau tuam leh pau haksate kiang a sawlna hi kei a, Israel inkawte kiang a sawl na hizaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nam pau tuam leh pau haksa a thu uh na theih theihlouhte kiang a sawl na hi kei hi. A kiang ua nang k’on sawl in pellou in na thu a ngaikhe mahmah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Israel inkawte’n a hon ngaikhe kei ding ua, kei a hon ngaikhe kei ding uhi, Israel inkawte tengteng taltang tak leh lungtang genhak mahmah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan ngai in, na mai amau mai lak ah khauhsak in, na taltang leng amau taltang sang a takzaw in k’on bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suang tak mahmah, meisuang sang a tak in na tal ka bawl a, lau kenla, a mithah uah lunglel sam ken, helhat inkuan hi mahle uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huailou leng ka kiang ah Mihing tapa, na kiang a ka thugen ding tengteng na bil in ngaikhia inla, na lungtang ah khum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuan inla, na chipih saltangte kiang vatung inla; a ngaikhia uhiam, a ngaikhe kei uhiam. “Hichibang Toupa thupawt ahi” chi in gen inla, hilh in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in kha in a hon domkangta a, amun a kipan Toupa thupina a dinkhiak lai in, ka nunglam ah zinling thawm ka za hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai tuh thilhingte kha kisukha leh a kiang ua kangtalai peite, zinling thawm bang nei ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in kha in a hon domkang a, a hon lamangta a: heh mahmah leh utlou pipi in ka kuanta hi, Toupa khut lah ka tung ah a hat ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in, Telabib a saltangte, Kebar lui a tengte kiang ka vatung a, a tutna uah ka tu a; lamdangsa tak in huai ah ni sagih ka tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in ni sagih bei in hichi ahi a, Toupa thu ka kiang a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel inkawte vilpa in nang k’on sep hi; huchi in ka kam a thu na za ding a, kei sik in amau vauna na pe ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Migilou kiang a ka thu, “Na si mahmah ding ahi” ka chih a, huai migilou a hinna hum ding a a gitlouhna lampi paisan ding a vauna na neih louh a, vauna thu leng na hilh sam louh a, huai migilou a gitlouhna a a sih leh a sisan mawh nang lak ah k’on sik ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh huai migilou na vau a, a gitlouhna a paisan louh a, a gitlouhna lampi a lehngatsan sam kei leh a gitlouhna ah a si ding a, nang bel na hinna na humbit ahizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan mi diktat in a diktatna lehngatsan a gitlouhna a hih a, a ma a pukna ka koih leh, a si ding: vauna na neih louh ziak in a khelhna ah a si ding a; a thil diktat a hihsate theihgige ahi kei ding; a sisan mawh ahihleh na lak ah k’on sik ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh mi diktat khiallou ding a na vau a, a khelh keileh vauna a khawksak ziak in a hing ding; nang leng na hinna na humbit ding hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan huai ah Toupa khut ka tung ah a om a, ka kiang ah, Thou inla, phaizang ah pai inla, huai ah k’on houpih ding, a chi a. Huchi in ka thou a, phaizang ah ka paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngai in, huai ah Toupa thupina, Kebar lui a ka muh thupina bang mai in a hong ding a, kei ka khup pukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in, kei ah kha a honglut a, ka khe in a hon dingsak a, a hon houpih a, Pai inla, na inn ah kikhak khum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang zaw, mihing tapa, khauhual in a honkhih ding ua, a hon gak ding ua, a lak uah na pawtkhe nawn kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na lei na dangtawng ah ka belhsak ding a, na pau nawn kei ding a, amaute salpa na hinawn kei ding, helhat inkuan ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh na kiang a thu ka gen hun chiang in na kam k’on ka sak ding a, a kiang uah “ Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: ‘A ngaikhia in ngaikhia henla, a ngaikhelou in ngaikhe kei hen, helhat inkuan ahi ngal ua, a chi’ ” chi in na gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang mihing tapa, teklei pek la inla, na ma ah koih in, huai tung ah khopi Jerusalem khopi lim bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kim a um in kulh khohkhum inla, mualpawng bawlkhum in sepaih giahbukte bawlkhum inla, kulh suksiatnate a kim in bawlkhum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikpek la inla, nangmah leh khopi kikal ah sik bang ding in tung in; huai lam masuan inla, um in a om ding a, nangmah in na um ding ahi. Hiai Israel inkawte adia etsak kholhna ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan nang bel na veilam pang delh in lum inla, a tung ah Israel inkawte gitlouhna nga in; a tung a nalup sung ni zah bangzel a gitlouhna uh na puak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A gitlouhna kumte uh nang ading a nite hi ding in lah ka septa ngal a, ni za thum leh ni sawmkua ding: Huchibang in Israel inkawte gitlouhna na paw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiaite na khit hun chiang in na taklam pang delh in na lum leuleu dia, Judah inkawte gitlouhna na paw ding: ni sawmli nang din ka sep a, ni khat kum khat zel hi ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ban khuhlou a zak in Jerusalem kisim lam nga inla, a tungthu gen khia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai in, khauhual in k’on hentawm a, khopi kisim sung nite a bei masiah koilam ah leng na kihei ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Buh, buhman, be, behiang, vai buhman la inla, bel khat ah koih inla, tanghou in bawl in; na pangkhat delh a na lup sung teng, ni za thum leh sawmkua sung, huai na ne ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na an nekding tehvek ding ahi, nikhat in sekel sawmnih ahi ding ahi: hunbi neitak in na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuite leng tehvek in na dawn ding ahi, hin khat seh guk suah a seh khat ahi ding ahi, hunbi neitak in na dawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mit muh un mihing ekgaw sing dia zang in na kang ding a, buhman tanghou nek in na ne ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n , “Hichibang an thanghuai Israel tate’n ka delhmangna ding namte lak ah a ne ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ken, “Eh! Toupa Pathian, Ngai dih, ka hinna hihnit ahi ngeikei a, ka tuailai a kipan tutan in leng, amah sih a si hiam, gamsa keih hiam ka ne ngei naikei a, sa kihhuai ka kam ah a lut ngei naikei hi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, “En in, mihing ek sik in bawng ek k’on pia, huaite zang in nek dingte na bawl ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huailou leng ka kiang ah, aman, “Mihing tapa, ngai dih, Jerusalem ah, an hinna bul ka hihse ding a, a an uh tehvek in lauthawng tak in a ne ding uh; tui leng tehvek in, lungkhamtak in a dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An leh tui tasam a, lungkhamtak a kientuah a, a gitlouhna ua a thammang khitna ding un.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, nang mihing tapa, namsau hiam mahmah la inla, na lu leh na khamul metna ding in sammetmi tem in zang in; huan bukna la inla, sam khen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seh thum a khen a seh khat sim a a omsung nite a bei hun chiang in khopi lai a mei ah na hal ding ahi; seh thum a khen a seh khat nawn na la dia, a kim ah namsau in na satnen ding ahi; huan, seh thum a khen a seh khat nawn huih mutleng ding in na thehzak ding hi, ken namsau in ka delh zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan tawmchik na la dia, na puanaktual mong ah na tun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiaite lak a tamlou na la ding a, mei ah na thehlut ding ahi, a kangding; huai a kipan in Israel inkawte tengteng ah mei a hongpawt ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Hiai Jerusalem khua ahi: namte laizang ah ka koih a, a kim ah gamte a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Namte sang a nakpi a gitlouhna hihzaw in ka thugel tung ah a hel a, a kim a gamte sang a thupi in ka dan bawl tung ah a hel uhi. Ka thugelte a paikhia ua, ka dan bawlte bang in a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Na kim a namte sang a buai hatzaw in na om a, ka dan bawl bang in na omkei a, ka thugelte leng na zuikei ua, namte adia ka thusehte na hihlouh ziak un, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un, kei nasan in leng k’on nang ahi, namte mitmuh ngei in na lak uah vaihawmna ka tangtung sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kihhuaina tengteng uh ziak in thil ka hih ngei nailouh, hih leng ka hih ngei nawnlouh ding na tung uah ka hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in pate’n na sung ah a tate uh a ne ding ua, tate’n leng a pate uh a ne ding uh; nang a mi omsun tengteng ka dalhsak vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in hiai Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi: Na nitna leh na kihhuainate a ka biakin na hihnit ziak in, a hin a ka hin laiteng, k’on kiam sak ding a, ka mit in a hon maih hetkei ding a, k’on hehpih sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Seh thum a khen a seh khat hi in hiam, kial in hiam na lak uah a si ding uh; seh thum a khen a seh khat nawn ka hihdalh ding a, namsau in ka delhzui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichibang in ka hehna ka tangtung sak ding a, a tung uah ka hehna ka lungdam sak ding a, ka om a nuamta ding hi: kei Toupa’n a tung ua ka hehna ka lungdam sak hun chiang in phatuamngaitak in ka genta chih a theikhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huailou in, na kim a namte lak ah leh vialvak tengtengte mitmuh in khaw segawp leh simmohhuai in k’on bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in, thangpai leh heh mahmah a, nakpi a taihilh a, na tung a thugelte ka tunsak hun in na kim a namte mitmuh in nuihsat leh kouna leh hilhna leh mulkimhuai na hi ding: Kei Toupa’n ka chita hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tung uah kialna thaltang hoihlou tak manna ding, noumau manna ding k’on kesak ding; na tung uah kialna ka uangsak ding a, na an uh, hinna bul ka hihse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in na tung uah kialna leh gamsa hangte k’on sawl ding a, ta leh nau tan in a hon laksak ding uhi; hipi leh sisansuahna na lak uah a leng ding; na tung uah namsau k’on lek ding, kei Toupa’n ka chita hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel tanglam nga inla, a kiang uah thu gen inla, Israel tangte aw, Toupa Pathian thu ngaikhia un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in tangte leh mualte kiang ah leh guamte leh kuamte kiang ah hichi in a chi: Ngai un, kei, keimahmah in na tung uah namsau ka honlik ding a, na munsangte uh ka hihse vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na maitamte uh a segawp ding a, na ni Pathian limte uh a kitam zan ding: na mi thah luangte uh na milimte uh ma ah ka pai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel tate luang a milimte uh ma ah ka koih ding a, na guhte uh na maitam kim uah ka theh zak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tenna mun tengteng uah khopi a se ding a, mun sangte a segawp ding; na maitamte uh hihsiat leh hihgawp a hih theihna ding un leh na milimte uh a kitapnen a, a man theihna ding in leh na ni Pathian limte uh phukpaih a a om theihna ding un, na nasepte uh aman theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan mi thahte na lak uah a puk ding ua, huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh gamchih a na dalhzak hun chiang un namte lak ah namsau pelte a om ding ziak un a khen k’on hawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan nalak ua kipan a pawtte’n sal a a pina namte uh lak ah kei a hon theigige ding ua, a angkawmna lungtang uh ka lakmang sakleh a mit uh, a milim lam ua angkawmte ka hihsiat sakdante a thei ding uh: thil gilou a na hih ziak uleh a kihhuai ziak un amau mitmuh ngei in leng kihhuai a kisa ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding ua, hiai thil hoihlou a kiang uah ka hih ding a, a mawk in ka chi kei chih a thei ding uh, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi a: Na khut beng in na khe pek inla, Maizen! Israel inkawte kihhuaina gitlouh ziak maw! Namsau in, kial in, hipi in a puk ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamlapi a om hipi in a si ding ua, a nai a om namsau in a puk ding ua, a val, um a omte kial in a si ding uh; hichibang in ka heh mahmahna a tung uah ka lungdam sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangsangte ah, mualvumte ah leh sing hing peuhmah nuai ah leh tosaw bawkpha chih nuai a a milimte uh kiang a gimlim a latna mun ua a maitam kim ua a milimte uh lak a a misi luangte uh a om hun chiang in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tung uah ka khut ka lik ding a, gamdai a kipan a Diblah lam a a tenna mun tengteng uah gam ka hihsia in ka hihgawp vek ding; huchi in kei Toupa ahi chih a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang mihing tapa, Toupa Pathian in Israel gam kiang ah hichi in a chi ahi: Tawpna, tawpna gam ning li ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu nang ading in tawpna ahi, na tung ah ka hehna k’on tungsak ding a, na omdan bangzel in vai k’on hawmsak ding a, na kihhuaina tengteng na tung ah k’on tun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mit in a honmaih kei dia, k’on hehpih sam kei ding hi: na omdan bang in na tung ah kontun zaw ding a, huchi in, Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Siatna, siatgawpna mah, ngai dih, a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tawpna a hongtung hi, tawpna a hongtung hi, na tung ah a hongthouta, ngai in, a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw gam luahpa, na siatna ding na tung ah a hongtung hi, hun a hongtung hi, ni a naita hi; buaina, kipak a tangtung a kikouna ni hilou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin ka hehna na tung ah k’on buakzok ding hi, na tung ah ka hehna ka lungdamsak ding a; na omdan bangzel in k’on vaihawmsak ding hi; na kihhuaina tengteng na tung ah kontun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan ka mit in a honmaih kei dia, k’on hehpih sam kei ding: na omdan bangzel in na tung ah ka hontun ding a, na kihhuaina leng na lak uah a om ding: huchi in kei Toupa gawt theipa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai in, a ni, ngai in, a hongtung hi, na siatna ding a pawtta, satna chiang a pakta, kisaktheihna a pakmumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiamgamna gitlouhna chiang a suakta ahi; kuamahmah a omta kei ding a, a husa uhiam, a hauhsakna uhiam leng: kuamah in a it sam kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hun a hongtungta, a ni a hongnaita: a leimi kipak kei henla, a khawngmi leng dah kei hen: thangpaihna avek ua tung ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawngmi in, damlai mah leh, a thil khot a munawn kei ding hi; kilakna avek ua tungthu ahi a, kuamah a kik kei ding uh, kuamah a nuntakna thulimlouhna uah a khosa suak sam kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pengkul a mut ua, bangkim a kimanta a; himahleh kidouna ah kuamah a hohkei ua; ka hehna avek ua tung ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inpua ah namsau, asung ah hipi leh kial: gam a om namsau in a si ding ua, khopi a om kial leh hipi in a nekhin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh a taikhete, a pawt ding ua, tangte ah phaizang gam vakhu bang in; avek un, lungzuangtak in amau thulimlouhna chiat ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khut tengteng a zaw ding a, khuk tengteng tui bang in a nem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saiip puan a teng ding ua, mulkimna in amau a tuam ding a, mel chiteng ah zumna a lang ding a, a lutang tengteng uh a giaukhin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dangkasik uh leh a dangkaengte un Toupa hehni chiang in a hunkhe theikei ding a, a hinna uh a taisak kei ding a, a gil uh a vahsak sam kei ding a, a thulimlouhna uh pukna a hihkhit tak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kizepna kilawmna uh a kisaktheihpih ua, a kihhuaina milim un leh a nitna thil un a suaksak zawlel uhi; huaiziak in amau ading in thil kihhuai ding in ka na bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan gallak ding in namdang khut ah ka pedia, lei a migiloute kiang ah gallak ding in ka pe ding a, amau a na hihnin ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute ka nungngatsan ding a, ka mun siang a hihnin ding uh: huan guta a honglut dia, a hihnin ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khainiang bawl un, gam lah sisan suahhat vaihawmna in a dim a, khopi hiamgamna in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in namdang giloupente k’on pilut ding a a innte uh a neihsak ding ua; a hatna otpih uh ka hihtawp ding a, a mun siangte uh hihnit in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lungzinna a hongtung a, muanna a zong ua, a om hetkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siatna tung ah siatsemna, thuthang tung ah thuthang a hongom ding a, zawlnei lak ah kilakna a zong ding ua, himahleh dante siampu lak ah a mang ding a, upate lak ah thudot a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa a dah ding a, kumpi tapa lungdonna puansilh in a kivan ding a, vantang khut leng a ling ding, a kiang uah a om danthu un ka hih ding a, a thilhih bangzel un vai ka hawmsak ding; huan Toupa ka hi chih a theita ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum gukna, kha gukna, huai kha ni ngani’n hichi ahi a, ka inn a ka tut a, Judah upate ka ma a a tut lai un Toupa Pathian khut ka tung ah a hongom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in ka en a, ngai in, mi mei bang a kimu a hongom a; a kawng chiang nuailam hidia kilawm mei bang ahi a; a kawng chiang tunglam bel sik hal-ap bang a vaktak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in khut bang a honsawk khia a, ka tal sam in a hon man hi, kha in lei leh van kikal ah a hon domkang a, Pathian kilakna in Jerusalem ah a honpi hi, Jerusalem mallam huang sungnung kongpi khakna kiang a hon tunta a, huai ah mullitna lim tutna mun a om a, huai in a mullit sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, ngai in, phaizang a ka muh bangmah in huai ah Israel Pathian thupina a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in aman ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, mallam nga in na mitsuan dihve leh, a chi hi. Huchi in mallam nga in ka mit ka suan a, ngai in, maitam kongpi mallam lutna ah hiai mullitna lim a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, a thilhih uh na mu hia? Israel inkawte’n thil kihhuai mahmah, hiai a a hih ngei uh, ka inn siangthou a kipan a gamla a ka paimangna dia a hih uh? Himahleh thildang kihhuai zaw na mu nawn lai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan huangsung lutna ah a honpi a; ka en a, bang ah vang a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, huai bang hon khuakdih” a chi hi. Ka khuak leh kongkhak a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Lut inla, hiai a khelhna kihhuai tak a hih uh en dih” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in ka lut a, ka mu a, ngai in, thil hing chichih limte, gamsa kihhuai limte, Israel inkawte milim tengteng bang ah a kimvel in a na tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan a ma uah Israel inkuan, upate lak a mi sawmsagihte a ding ua, a laitak uah Sephan tapa Jaazaniah a ding a, michih in belhbu a tawi chiat ua; huan gimlim khu gim a zam tou ngoingoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, Israel inkuan upate mial nuai a thilhih na mu hia? Michih in milim dantan a a hih uh? Toupa’n a hon mu kei a, Toupa’n gam a paisanta a ka, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kiang ah,“A thilhih uh kihhuai sem dang leng na mu nawn lai ding” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa inn mallam panglutna kongkhak ah a honpi a, ngai dih, huai ah numeite Tamuz ngai in kap in a tu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, Aw mihing tapa, hiai na mu hia? Hiai sang a kihhuai zawsem na mu nawnlai ding a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Toupa in um sungnungzaw ah a honpi lut a, ngai in, Toupa inn siangthou kongkhak ah Inlim leh maitam kikal ah mi sawmnih leh nga Toupa inn siangthou lam nungngat a, a maite uh suahlam nga in a na om ua, suahlam ah ni a na bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, aman ka kiang ah, “Hiai na mu hia, aw mihing tapa, a thil kihhuai hih uh, hiai a hih uh Judah inkawte ding in thil neutham hia? Gam hiamgamna in a hihdim ua, hon hehsak nawnsem ua, a nak uah sing hiang a bat uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in ken leng hehtak in ka hih ding a; ka mit in a maih kei dia, ka hehpih sam kei ding; aw ngaihtak in ka bil ah hong kikou mahle uh ka ngaikhe kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in bil a ka zak in, “Khopi kemmite michih hihmanna van tawi in hongnai uhen” chi in ngaihtak in a kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan ngai in, mallam kongpi tungnung paina a kipan in mi guk a hongpai ua, michih in hihlupna van a tawichiat ua; a lai ua mi khat puanmalngat silh in laituibuk a kuah hi. A lut ua, dal maitam kiang ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan Israelte Pathian thupina a omna Cherub a kipan in huai inn kongpi kiang ah a paitou a; puanmalngat silh, laituibuk kuahpa a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a kiang ah, “Khopi sung tawnsuak inla, Jerusalem tawnsuak in; a sung a thil kihhuai hihsate ziak a tunggik a kapte a tal uah chiamteh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan midangte kiang ah ka zak mahmah in, “A nung ah khopi tawnsuak unla, khut kha un, na mit un a muh maih kei henla, hehpih sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Putekte, tangvalte, nungakte, naupangte leh nute that siangvek un. Chiamtehna neite bel honnaih kei un; ka Mun Siangthou ah pan un” a chi hi. Huchi in, biakin kong a upate inn ah a panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Inn hihbuah unla, a um sungte mi luang in dimsak unla: pawt un” a chi hi. Huan, a pawtta ua, khopi ah a gamtangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, khopi ah a gamtat lai un kei bel nutsiat in ka na om a, a khup in ka puk hi. “Ah! Toupa Pathian, Jerusalem tung a na heh sunbuak ah Israel omsunte leng na hihmang vek sawm na hiam?” chi in ka kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in aman ka kiang ah, “Israel leh Judah inkawte thulimlouhna a thupi tel a ahi. ‘Gam sisan in a dim a: khopi vaihawmna kaihkawi in a om a, Toupa’n gam a paisanta a, Toupa’n bangmah a mu sam a!’ a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mit in amau ka maih kei ding a, ka hehpih sam kei ding hi; a gitlouh uh avekpi in amau ka khusak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in ngai in, puanmalngat silh a laituibuk kuahpa’n thu a tun a, N’on thupiak bang in ka hihkhinta, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in ka en a, ngai in, cherubte lu tung a van dum om ah sapphir suang hileh kilawmtak, mangtutphah bangtak a kimu a honglang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman puanmalngat silhpa kiang ah, “Cherub nuai a kangtalai peite kikal ah valut inla, cherubte kikal a meivu na khut langnih dim in valuak inla, khopi tung ah thehzak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mitmuh lai mahmah in a kuanta hi. Huan mi a hohlai in cherubte Inpi taklam pang ah a ding ua; huang sungnung pen meipi in a dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa thupina cherubte a kipan a paitou a, biakin kongpi tung ah a vadingta a, huai inn meipi in a dim a, huangsung Toupa thupina vak in a dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cherubte khazap gingte huangsung pawnung zaw leng Pathian Bangkim hihthei in a hon houpih lai a a om bang mai in a kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, puanmalngat silhpa kiang ah, “Cherubte kikal a kangtalai pei kikal a kipan mei vala in” chi a thu a piak leh, amah a valut a, kangtalai khe chin ah a dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan cherubim, cherubte kikal a kipan in, cherubte kikal a mei om a sawka, a la a, puanmalngat silhpa khut ah a pia a, aman a na la a, a pawtkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in cherubte bel a kha nuai uah mihing khut bangtak a honglang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan ka en a, ngai in, cherubte sik ah kangtalai khe li, Cherub khat kiang ah, kangtalai khe khat, Cherub dang kiang ah kangtalai khe dang ka mu a; kangtalai khe latdan bel beril suang zia bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A latdan un a li un kibatna khat a nei ua, kangtalai khe khat sung a kangtalai khe dang om bang mai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pai chiang un sikli in a pai thei ua, a pai un leng a kihei ngeikei uh; himahleh amasa ngatna lam a zuizel uhi, a pai un a kihei tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan a pumpi uh a pum in a nungte uh, a khutte uh, a khate uleh kangtalai khete leng a kim in mit in a dim a, a li ua kangtalai khete leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kangtalai khete bil a ka zak mahmah in, “Kangtalai khe kipei” chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Michih in mel li chiat a nei ua, mel khat Cherub mel ahi a, nihna mihing mel ahi a, thumna humpinelkai mel, lina muvanlai mel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in cherubte a paitou ua; hiai bel Kebar luigei a thil hing ka muh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, cherubte a pai uleh kangtalai khete a kiang uah a paitei a, cherubte’n lei a kipan paitou ding a a khate uh a zak uleh kangtalai khete’n a lehngatsan ngeikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A din uleh hiaite a ding tei ua, a paitouh uleh hiaite a paitei zel ua, thil hing kha amau ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa thupina Inpi kongpi tung a kipan a pawtkhia a, cherubte tung ah a dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan cherubte’n a kha a zak ua, a pawt un ka mit muh mahmah in lei a kipan a paitou ua; kangtalai khete a kiang uah a om zel a: huan Toupa Inn lutna suahlam kongkhak chin ah a dingta hi; Israel Pathian thupina a tung uah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai bel Kebar lui a Israel Pathian nuai a ka thil hing muh mah ahi; cherubte ahi uh chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Michih in maituam li leh kha li a neichiat ua, a kha nuai uah mihing khut bang mai a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan a mel lam uh ahihleh Kebar lui a ka muh melte mah bang, a latdan uleh amau mahmah leng ahi uhi; huan a mazawn zel uah a paichiat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan kha in a hon domkang a, Toupa’n inn suahlam lutna, suahlam muhna a hontun a: ngai in, lutna kongkhak chin ah mi sawmnih leh nga a na om ua: a lak uah Azzur tapa Jaazaniah leh Benaiah tapa Pelatiah, mipi heutute, ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, hiaite gitlouhna sawmkhete ahi ua, hiai khopi ah gitlouh sawmkhe mite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn lam hun ahi naikei hi; hiai khopi sa ui bel ahi a, eite a sa i hi uh” chite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in thu gen inla, aw mihing tapa, a tung uah thu gen in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan Toupa kha ka tung ah a hongtung a, aman ka kiang ah, “Gen in, Toupa’n hichi in a chi a: Hichibang in na hihsek ua, aw Israel inkawte aw, na lungsim ua thil hongtungte ka thei siang vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai khopi ah na mithahte uh na pungsak huthut ua, a kongzingte na mithah un na dimsakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n Pathian in hichi in a chi: Na mi thah uh a lai a na koihte uh a sa ahi ua; hiai khopi a sa ui bel ahi, himahleh a lai a kipan suankhiak in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Namsau na kihta ua, na tung uah namsau ka hontun ding, Toupa’n Pathian in a chi ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lai a kipan ka hon pawtkhe sak ding a, namdangte khut ah k’on mansak ding a, na tungthu uh a ngaihtuah ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namsau in na si ding ua, Israel gamgi lam ah na tungthu uh ka ngaihtuah ding: huchi in kei Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai khopi na sa ui bel uh ahi kei ding a, nou a sung a sa na hi sam kei ding ua, Israel gamgi lam ah na tungthu uh ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n ka hi chih na theita ding uh, ka dan bawl na zuikei ua, ka thupawt leng na zui sam kei ua: na kim ua namte hihdan na zui zawta uh” a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, thu ka gen a leh Benaiah tapa Pelatiah a na sita mai a, Huchi in ka khuppuk a, aw ngaihtak in ka kikou in, “Ah, Toupa Pathian: Israel omsunte chimihna na bawl ding ahia?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah”:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing tapa, na unaute, na chi leh kuangte ngei leh Israel inkawte tengteng, avek un. “Jerusalem luah mite’n Toupa a kipan paimang un, hiai gam kou adia piak ahita hi” a chihnate uh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Gamlapi ah namte lak ah ka suanmang a, gam tampi ah ka hihdalh na a, sawtloukal in a va tunna gam uah amau ding in Mun Siangthou ka hi ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: Namdangte a kipan in k’on pikhawm nawn ding a, na dalhna gam ua kipan k’on kaikhawm nawn ding. Israel gam k’on pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in huai ah a hongpai ding ua, thil nin tengteng leh thil kihhuai a kipan a lamang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungtang khat ka pe ding a, na sung uah lungsim thak ka koih ding: Huan a sa ua kipan lungtang sak ka lamang ding a, lungtang nem a kiang uah ka pe ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka dan bawlte a zuih ua, ka thusehte a vom ua, a hih theihna ding un, Huchi in ka mite ahi ding ua, keileng a Pathian uh ka hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nitna uleh a kihhuaina laigil lungtang zuite bel a khelhna uh avek in amau ka khusak ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in cherubte’n a khate uh a zak ua, a kiang uah kangtalai khete a om a, Israelte Pathian thupina a tung uah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa thupina khopi lai a kipan in a paitou a, khopi suahlam pang a tang sang ah a vadingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan kha in a hon domkangta a, kilakna ah Pathian kha in Kaldai gam a saltangte kiang ah a hontun hi. Huchi in ka kilakna muh in a hon paitouh santa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in saltangte kiang ah Toupa’n thil a hon etsak tengteng ka genta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a, ka kiang ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, helhat inkuan, muhna ding mit nei a mulou, zakna ding bil nei a zaloute lak ah om na hi, helhat inkuan ahi him uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in, nang mihing tapa, saltanna a paiding bang in na vante lomgak dimdiam inla, sun khovak ah a mitmuh mahmah un paikhia in: a muh mahmah na mun ua kipan mun dang ah na paikhe ding ahi: helhat inkuan ahi ua, a kingaihtuah loh khamai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan na van sun khovak in a mitmuh mahmah uah saltang pai ding van lak in na lakhe ding a, nang mahmah leng a mitmuh uah gamdang a khakmang ding pai in na pai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mitmuh mahmah uah kulhbang vangsak inla, huai ah lakhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mitmuh mahmah uah na paw ding a, mial ah na paikhe ding ahi: lei na muh louhna ding in na mai na khuh ding ahi; Israel inkawte ading in etsak kholhna din nang k’on bawl ahi ngal a, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a hon thupiak bang in ka hihta; ka van saltang ding van bang in sun khovak in ka lakhia a, ka khut in bang ka sunvang a, khomial lai in ka lakhia a, a mitmuh mahmah uah ka pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan zingsang in Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel inkuan, helhat inkuante’n na kiang ah. “Bang hih na hia?” a honchi uh ahi keimaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kiang uah “ Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: hiai thuphuan Jerusalem heutute leh Israel inkaw pumpi, a omna uh mite tungthu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou adin etsak kholhna ka hi a, ka chih bang geiha a tung ua hih ahi ding; khak mang in, saltang ding in a paimang ding uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan a lak ua heutu omsun in mialnuai ah a liang in a paw ding a, a paikhe ding: a lakkhiakna ding un bang a vangsak ua, a mit in gam a muh nawnlouh ziak in a mai a khuh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah ka len in ka khuh ding a, ka thang a awk ahi ding: Kaldai gam a Babulon ah k’on pi ding a, muh zaw a mu kei ding; huai ah a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah panpih ding a a kiang a omte leh a chingmite tengteng gamchih ah ka hihzak ding a, namsau dok in ka delh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan namte lak a ka delhzak a, gamchih a ka hihdalh hun chiang in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh namsau, kial, hipi a kipan mi tawmchik ka hawi ding; huaite’n a hongpaina gam ua namte kiang ah a kihhuaina tengteng a phuanna ding un; kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing tapa, na an ling vonvon kawm in ne inla, na tui lungzing a lingkawm in dawn in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan gam a mite kiang ah Toupa Pathian in Jerusalem a tengte tungtang ah leh Israel gam tungtang ah hichi in a chi ahi: A ante uh lau kawm in a ne ding ua, a tui uh lungzingtak in a dawn ding ua, a gamsung a tengte hiamgamna ziak in asung a thilom tengteng a kipan hihgawp in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in mi tenna khopite a inn-gam ding a, gam hihsiat in a om ding a, huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel gam a hiai paunak na neih uh bang chihna ahia? “A nite a sawt chian kilakna peuhmah a vuaksuak nawn zel” na chih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in “ Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Hiai paunak ka hihbei ding a, Israel gam ah a zang nawn ngeikei ding uh; kilakna tundik ni ding a naita a, chi in a kiang uah genzaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel inkuante lak ah kilakna hong vuaksuak leh aisan hoihlam a maitang phatna a omta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa ka hi a, ka gen ding a, ka gen tangtun ahi ding a, sit ahi kei ding: Aw helhat inkuante aw, na damlai mahmah un thu ka gen ding hi, ka tang tungsak pahding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing tapa, ngai in, “Israel inkawte a min Kilakna a muhte bel ni tampi ading ahi a, a genkholhte leng gamlapi ding ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ka thu bangmah sit ahi kei ding a, ka thugen peuhmah hih tangtun in a omzaw ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in hilh in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihing tapa,” Israel zawlnei, amah lungtang kia a kipan a gen chingte tung ah thu gen inla, “ Toupa thu ngai un” Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zawlnei hai, amau ngaihdan zui a, bangmah muloute tung a gik hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Israel, na zawlneite khawpi sesa a sehal om banglel ahita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa ni a kidouna ading zou ding a kulhbang dingkip sak ding leh Israel inkawte hum ding a kulhbang lam ding in na paitou kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Toupa thupawt ahi” chi mite’n bangmahlou lel leh genkholhna lim lel a tang ua, Toupa sawl ahi kei uhi; a thu uh hingei ding bang in mite a gingta sak ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kilakna hong vuaksuak lel na mu un, thugenkholh dik lou na gen uh ahi kei maw? “ Toupa thupawt ahi” na chi nawn ngal ua, ken ka gen ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Bangmahlou phet na gen ua zuau lel na muh ziak un, ngai un, ka honnang ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan ka khut in bangmahlou mute leh zuaugen kholmite a nang ding a, ka mite kidot khawmna ah a tel kei ding ua, Israel inkuante min gelhna ah gelh in a omsam kei ding; huchi in Toupa Pathian ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Galmuanna omloupi a, “Muan huai e” chi a mite a pimang ziak un leh mi bang bawl a, sunu nuhmite’n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ke nawn mai ding, vuahpi a hongzu ding a, nou gial lian pite aw, na hong ke ding ua, huih thupi in a hihse ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai un, bang a chip khit chiang in, “Na sunu nuh uh koi ah, a honchi kei ding ua hia?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ka heh in huihpi thupi in ka hihse vek ding, ka heh in vuahpi a hongzu ding a, ka heh in gial thupitak hihmang ding in a hong ke ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in sunu na nuh ngou bang uh ka chim sak ding a, lei pha in a chim dia, huchi in a suangphumte a dawk hial ding hi: huan a chim ding a, bang chim ah hihmang in na om ding uh; huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichibang in bang tung ah leh sunu nuhmite tung ah ka hehna ka damsak ding; huan, bang a om nawn kei a, a bangzutte leng a om nawnta kei uh, k’on chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai bel Israel zawlnei Jerusalem tung thugen a, galmuanna omloupi a galmuanna musakmite ngei, a om nawn kei uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang mihing tapa, na mite tanute, a lungtang lel ua genmite masuan inla, amau kalh in thu gen in, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Numei, mite ban a sik bunsak leh mi hinnate mat belhna ding a mi liante lu khuhna khuimite a tung uh a gik hi: Nou hinna ding in ka mite hinna na man ding uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Buhman tawmchik leh tanghou them mu ding a si lou ding sisak ding leh hing lou ding hingsak ding in na zuaugen uh ka mite’n a up ziak un ka mite lak ah ka min a thanghuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi a: Ngai un, mi hinna, vasa bang a man ding a na thil butsakte uh ka mudah ahi; na bante uh ka bot ding a, na mimat dingte uh vasa bang a na mat dingte uh hinna ka pawtsak vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lukhuhnate uh leng ka botkek ding a, ka mite na khut ua kipan ka suakta sak ding, na mat theih ding un na khut uah a omta kei ding uh; huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei lungkham sak hilou a, mi diktatte lungtang zuau a na hihnat ziak un leh migilou hingdam a a omna ding a a khelhna lampi a kipan a kilehhei louhna ding in migilou khutte na hihhat ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in bangmahlou lel, thu genkhol diklou hiam zaw na mu nawn kei ding uh; huan ka mite na khut ua kipan ka hunkhe ding a, Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh, a chi, chi in gen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Israel upa khenkhatte ka kiang ah a hongpai ua, ka ma ah a tu ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtungta, ka kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing tapa, hiai mite’n a milimte uh a lungtang uah a lalut ua, a ma uah a thulimlouhna pukna uh a koih uhi; kei hon dong peuhmah ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in, amau houpih inla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Israel inkuan a michih a lungtang ua milim lalut a, a ma ua a thulimlouhna pukna koih a, zawlnei kiang a hongpai peuhmah kei Toupa’n a milim uh tamdan bangzel in ka dawng ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel inkawte a milim uh ziak a hon na omtuam san ziak ua a lungtang ua ka mat theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Israel inkawte kiang ah Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Hongkik unla, na milimte ua kipan in hongkik un, na kihhuaina tengteng uh lehngatsan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel inkaw lak a mi kuapeuh hiam, mikhual Israel gam a teng tei hiam, kei a kipan a kihihtuam, a lungtang ua milim lalut a, a ma ua thulimlouhna pukna koih kawm a, a tungtang ua hondong ding a zawlnei kiang a hohkei leh Toupa ngei in ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai mi ka masuan ding a, min lamdang a sak ding in tangtawn tangtawn a gen ding in ka mite lak a kipan ka hihmang ding; huchi in kei Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan zawlnei khem a om in thugen henla, kei Toupa’n zawlnei ka khem ahi a, a tung ah ka khut ka lik ding a, ka mi Israelte lak a kipan ka hihmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thulimlouhna uh a paw ding ua: Zawlnei thulimlouhna amah dongmite thulimlouhna bang mai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel inkawte kei a kip a a man nawnlouh ua, a tatleknate tengteng ua a kihihnit nawn sam louhna ding un, ka mite a hihzawk ua a Pathian uh ka hih theihna ding in, Toupa Pathian in a chi, chiin gen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing tapa, gam mite’n tatlekna thilhih a, ka tung a thil hihkhial a, ken ka khut ka lik a, a an uh, hinna bul ka hihsiat a, a tung ua kial ka tunsak a, mi leh sate k’on hihman leh hiai mi thum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Noah, Daniel leh Job hial leng hongom bang hileh, a diktatna un amau hinna kia a humbit ding ahi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gam sahangte a gam uh ka tuansuak sak a, gam a hihsiat ua, a hong kigawp a, gamsa ziak a kuamah paisuak ding a omkei uleh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai mi thumte om le uh, a hin a ka hin laiteng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, a tanute uh, a tapate uh a humbit tuankei ding uh: amau kia hotdam in a om ding ua, gam a segawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihkeileh huai gam ah namsau ka lik dia, “Namsau, gamsung teng ah gamtang in” mi leh gamsa ka gawimang ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai mi thumte om le uh leng, a hin a ka hin laiteng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, a tanute uh, a tapate uh a humbit tuankei ding ua, amau hinna kia humbit in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihkeileh, huai gam ah, hipi k’on lensak a, mi leh sa hihmang ding a sisan suah a ka hehna huai gam tung a k’on sun leh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah, Daniel leh Job hial leng na om le uh, a hin a ka hin sung teng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, a tanu uhiam, a tapa uhiam a humbit kei ding ua, a diktatna un amau hinna ngei a humbit lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ngal a: Jerusalem tung a ka vaihawmna na mahmah lite, namsaute, kialte, gam sahangte, hipite, mi leh sa gawimang vek ding a kontut hun chiang in bangzah a thupi ahi diam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh ngai in, huailai a omsun pikhiak dingte nutsiat in a om ding ua, tanute leh tapate leng: ngai un, a kiang uah a hong pawtkhe ding ua, a omdan uh a thilhihte na mu ding uh, Jerusalem tung a thil hoihlou ka hontut thu ah lungmuan in na om ding ua, a tung a kontut tengteng thu ah leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A omdan uleh a thilhihte uh na muh hun chiang un a hon lungmuan ding uh; a tung a ka thilhih tengteng hihsan neilou in ka hihkei chih na thei ding uh chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, gammang nuai a sing lak a Grepgui sing dang sang in bang ahi a leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sing thil bawlna dia zat ahi hia? Tuium-belsuan khaina ding in kuan a zang ngei a leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, mei a paihlut ahi a, toh ding in mei in a kangmang, a mong langnih, a kangkhin a a lai ah phattuamna a nei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, a bitlai nangawn in a phatuam kei: phatuam sin kei na tel e, a kat khitnung in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: gamnuai singlak a grepguite, toh ding in mei ah ka khul maimah bang in, Jerusalem luahmite ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau ka masuan ding a, pawt mahle uh, mei a kipan, a kang bei ding, mei in, Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding ua, amaute ka masuan hun chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gam uh ka hihgawp ngei ding ahi, thulimlouhna a hih ziak un chih Toupa thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Jerusalem a kihhuainate theikhe sak inla, a kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in Jerusalem kiang ah hichi in a chi ahi: Na pawtna gam leh na pianna gam Kanan mite gam ahi a, na pa Amor mi ahi a, na nu Hit mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan na pianna thu bel na pian ni’n na laigui at ahi kei a, nang hihsiang ding a tui a sil na hisam kei, chi nuh na tuak kei a, tuam lum na hi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lainat ding a na tung a hiaite hih ding in kuamah mit in nang a hon hehpih kei ua: gam lak a paihkhiak na hita, na pian ni a kipan kiha om na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan na kiang a k’ong pai in sisan a talin k’on mu a, na kiang ah, “Sisan ah om lechin leng ‘hing in!’ k’on chi a”: ahi, ka honchi ahi; “Sisan ah om mahle chin ‘hing in!’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam thil pakmum bang in k’on khangsak a, na sam a hong hoih a; savuak leh vuaktang lel na hi lailai hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan na kiang a k’ong pai a k’on etin, deihhuai tham na hong hita a, ka puan k’on zawn a, na vuaktanna k’on khuhta hi: ahi, na kiang ah ka kichiam a, thukhun ah k’on lutpih a, kei a na hita hi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in tui in k’on sil a, ahi, na sisan k’on hihsiang sipsip a, sathau k’on nuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puanzem in k’on van a, saham vun khedap k’on bunsak a, puanmalngat hoih in k’on van a, silk puan k’on khusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kizepna hoih in k’on zem a, na khut ah taute, na ngawng ah dangkaeng khainiangte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nak ah nakbulhte, na bil ah bilbahte, na lu ah lallukhu hoihtak in k’on zem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in dangkaeng leh dangkasik a zephoih na hita a, na puansilhte puanmalngat hoihtak leh silpuan leh puankhui kilawm ahi a: na nek tangbuang nel leh khuaizu leh sathau ahi, na kilawm mahmah a, kumpinu leng na ching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kilawmna namte lak ah a thangkhia a, ka thupina a kivan in na buchingta, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh na kilawmna na muang lua a, na minthanna na hukloh a, mi vialvak peuh leh na muh peuh na luppih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na puansilhte suah in mun sangte na zuan a, huai ah kizuak in na pang a, hichibang in na om ngei nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka dangkaeng leh ka dangkasik tuium-belsuan hoih taktak k’on piak na la a, pasal limbawlna ding in na zang, na hukpihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puansilh khui kilawmte na la a, amau na tuam a, ka sathaute leh ka gimlimte a ma uah na tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />K’on tanghou piak leng ka tangbuang hoih leh sathau leh khuaizu k’on vaknate gimlim ding in a ma uah na lui a; hichi a hong hita, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huailou leng na tanu, na tapa, n’on suansakte a kiang uah kithoihna ding in zat bei din na pia a: na hukna thil namai ahi ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tate na thah a, meipi a pailut a a kiang ua na latte?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na kihhuaina leh na hukna tengteng ah na naupanlai a vuaktang a na om leh na sisan a na tal maimah laite na thei nawnta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan hiai na thulimlouhna tengteng khit in leng, hichi a honghi a, na tung a gik hi: Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mun kiphoute na kibawlna, kongzing chiteng ah mun sangte na lam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lampi kipatna tengah munsang na lam a, na kilawmna kihhuai in na bawl a vialvak peuhmahte kiang ah na kilem dawk a, na hukna a uang semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta mi, na inveng, sami mahmah toh kingaihna khelhna leng na hihta; hon hehsak ding in na hukna na uangsakta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaiziak in ngai in, na tung ah ka khut ka lik a, na annek ka kiamsak a, nang hon mudah Philistia tanute, na hukdan zumpih mahmah nute kiang ah ut ut a a honbawl ding un k’on peta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Assuria mite kiang ah leng na kizuak a, huntawk chih lah nei tellou chin a; ahi, a kiang uah kizuak in na pang a, na kham tuan sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kanan gam ah, Kaldai mite kiang ah na hukna na uangsak lailai a, na kham tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang lungtang seta namai e, na tatdan numei genhak gilou mahmah mai thil na hih a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lamka thuam teng a milim biakna inn na bawl a, kongzing chih a munsangte na bawlte loh na delhlouh ziak in kizuak leng na bang kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Zi angkawm, pasalte sang a mi tuam deihzaw nu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kizuak kiang ah thil a pesek ua, nang bel na lehpiak a hon deihmi ang ah, gamchih a kipan a hongpai ua, a hon luppih theihna ding un na nou zawnak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huan na huk thu a kuamah in a honzot louh midang toh na kibatlouhna uh ahi; nang a man na pe zawsop a, kuamah in man a honpiak louh uh na lamdanna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huaiziak in aw mi huknu, Toupa thu ngai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Na kihhuaina buakkhiak a hih a, na mingaihte toh na kithuahna lam ua na vuaktanna suklat a hih ziak leh na kihhuaina milim tengteng ziak leh a kiang ua na piak na tate sisan ziak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngai in, nang hon ngaimi na nuamtatpihte tengteng leh na nangaih khitsa tengteng leh na muhdahte tengteng ka samkhawm ding a, he, na kim ah ka pikhawm ding a, na vuaktanna tengteng a muh theihna ding un a kiang uah na vuaktanna ka hihlang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huan numei pasal khen a, amah ta sisan suah tungthu a bang in k’on vaihawm khum ding; hehna leh mullitna sisan na tung ah ka tungsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A khut uah k’on pedia, na mun kidohte a hihpuk ding ua, na munsangte a chimsak ding ua; na puansilhte a suah ding ua, na suangmantamte a honsut ding ua, savuak leh vuaktang in a hon nuse ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na tung ah mipi a kaikhawm ding ua, suang in a hon deng ding ua, namsau in a hon kui pailet ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na innte mei in a hal ding ua, numei tampi mitmuh in na tung ah vaihawmna a tangtung sak ding uh; na hukna ka tawpsak ding a, loh leng na pe ta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huchi in ka hehna na tung ah ka lungdam sak ding a, k’on mullitna a daita ding, ka daidide dia, ka heh ngei nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na tuailai nite na theihgige louh a, hiai thilte a n’on vuisak zawk ziak in ngai in, na tatdan dan, na tung ah ka tun ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi: huan na kihhuaina tengteng behlap in hiai hukna na hih nawn kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai in, paunak zang peuhmah in hiai paunak a zang ding uh, A tanu in a nu a sun, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na nu, amah pasal leh tate mudahnu tanu na hi a, ki tanauna lam ah bel, amah pasal leh tate mudahnu tanau na hi: na nu Hit mi ahi a, na pa Amor mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Huan, na tanau, na u bel Samaria, na veilam a teng amah leh a tanute toh ahi uh; na tanau, na nau, na taklam a teng Sodom leh a tanute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Himahleh amau omdan na zuikei a, a kihhuaina bang uh na hih keina a, na omdan tengteng a na thulimlouh zawkdan ngaihtuah in huaite bangmah tham ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A hin a ka hin sungteng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, nang leh na tate’n a hih bang uh na tanau Sodom leh a tanute’n leng a hih hetkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na tanau Sodom thulimlouhna hiaite ahi: kisaktheihna, nekvah luatnate, amah leh a tanute nuamtat mawkmawkte ahi, mi gentheite leh tasamte a panpih tuan sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Huan mi uang ahi ua, ka ma a thil kihhuai hihsa ahi uh; huchi in hoih ka sak bang in ka hihmangta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Samaria in na khelhna kimkhat leng a hih sam kei; amau sang a na kihhuainate na nak hihzawk ziak in na hihsa na kihhuaina tengteng in na sangamnute siam na tangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na sanggamnute dikzaw a na suklat ziak in nangmah in na zahlakna na puak ding ahi; amau sang in thil kihhuai uangzawte na hih a, na khelhnate ziak in amau nang sang in a diktat zaw uhi; ahi, na sanggamnute siam na tansakna ah nang anen aham in zahlakna na tang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Huan a omdan uh, Sodom leh a tanu omdante, Samaria leh a tanu omdante, amaute toh ton in nang omdan mahmah ka hei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Amau dia lungmuanna nana hih sekna a na thilhihsa tengteng ziak a na zum theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Huan na sanggamnute, Sodom leh a tanute, Samaria leh a tanute a omdan uh masa bang in a omnawn ding ua; nang leh na tanu leng na omdan uh masa bang in na omnawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na thulimlouhna muh khiak a hih ma a na kihihthupi nite in na sanggamnu Sodom na kamse khuahna ahi sek kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tun zaw Suria tanu leh a kim a mi tengteng, Philistia tanute na kim a hon simmawh mite’n a hon genseta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Na hukna leh na kihhuaina na paw zel ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Thukhun bohsia in thuchiam na khawksak louhdan bangzel in na tung ah ka hih teisin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Himahleh na naupanlai a na kiang a ka thukhun ka theigige ding a, na kiang ah tangtawn thukhun ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Huchi in na sanggamnute ka pom hun chiang in na omdante na honthei khe ding a, na kizumpih ding: amau lah na tanu ding in ka honpia hi, na thukhun ziakbel hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Na kiang a ka thukhun ka hihkip ding a, Toupa ka hi chih na theita ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Na thilhih tengteng k’on ngaihdam vek hun chiang in na theihgigena na zum ziak a na kamkat mahmah nawn louhna ding in, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel inkawte kiang ah thuhaksa bawlkhia inla, gentehna in gen in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi, chi in: Muvanlai lianpi, kha zapi, khaveng saupi gial em um, mul bittak Lebanon tang ah a leng a, Sidar sing zik a tuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hiang ziknou pen a kitan a, mi vialvakna gam ah a lenpih a, sumsinna khopi ah a phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai gam haichi leng a tuah a, leihoih ah a pawi pou a, tui tampi gei ah a phut a, nahkai sing bang in a phut hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan a khang a, grepgui niam bilbial a honghi a, selte a honsuah a, a hiangte a hong dawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muvanlai lianpi dang a om nawn a, kha zapi leh mul bittak a nei tei a, ngai in, hiai grep kung amah lam ah a zung a zam a: a suanna mun a kipan in amah lam ah hiangte a pou khia a, amah tui a a vak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiangte a suah a, grep hoihtak a hih theihna ding in tui tampi gei a lei hoih a phuh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: A piching den dia hia? A vuai maimah theihna ding in a nahte satkhia in, a zung toh a botkhe kei dia hia? Anah selthak tengteng in leng a vuailoh ding; a zung toh botkhe ding in thilhihtheihna thupitak hiam, muvanlai tampi a kiphamoh tuankei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi, ngai in, phuh hileh leng a piching den dia hia? Suahlam huih in a honnuai hun chiang in a vuai khin maimah kei dia hia? A pouna mun mah ah a vuai maimah ding chi in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Helhat inkawte kiang ah gen in, hiai thil omdan a theikei ua hia? Hilh in, ngai un, Babulon kumpipa Jerusalem ah a hongpai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kumpipa uleh a heutu uh a man a, amah kiang ah Babulon ah a pi a, a kumpipa uh suan khat a man a, thukhun a bawlpih a, thu a chiam teitei a, gam a miliante a pimang vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lalna gam a keniam a, amah a a dinkhiak theih nawn louhna ding in a thukhun lenkawm kia a a din theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh sakolte leh mi tampi honsawl ding a ngen ding in Aigupta gam a palai sawl in a tung ah a helta hi. A lohching ding hia? Hichibang hihmi a suakta ding hia? Thukhun hihse ngal in a pawtkhe thou ding hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi; kumpipa, kumpipa dia bawlpa tenna ngei ah a kichiamnate musit leh, a thukhunte bohsia a, amah kiang mahmah ah Babulon ah a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tampi hihlup ding a mualpawngte leh kulhte a bawl hun chiang un leng Pharo sepaih hon leh pawl thupi mahmah leng bangmah a hihsak theikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thukhun bohsia in kichiamna a musitta ngal ua: thu a kichiam nung in hiai thil tengteng a hih nawn a, a suakta peuhmah kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: ka kichiamna a musit a, ka thukhun a bohsia a, a hin a ka hin laiteng, amah tung ah ka bung ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Len in ka khuh ding a, ka thang ah a awk ding a, Babulon ah konpi ding a, huchi in a bohsiatna, ka tung ngei a a bohsiatnate ziak in amah ka sual ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan a pawl tengteng a taikekte tengteng namsau in a si ding ua, a omlaite kawlmong chih ah a dalh ding uh: huan kei Toupa’n ka genta chih a thei khe ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: "Sidar sang mahmah dawn ken ka la ding a, ka phut ding; a zikpi pen a ziknou ka khiak ding a, tang sang kidoh ah ka phut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel sanna tan ah kaphut ding a, hiangte a hong sel ding ua, a hong gah ding, sidar thupitak ahi ding; a nuai ah tungleng vasa chichih a teng ding ua, a hiang limte ah a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan gam sing tengteng in kei Toupa’n sing sangte ka niamsak a, sing niamte ka sangsak a, sing hingte ka keusak a, sing keute ka hingpha sak a, ka chi nalai hi, a chi hi. Kei Toupa'n ka genta a. Ka gen bang in ka hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel gam tungtang a hiai paunak a zat uh bang chihna ahia, Pate’n grep thuk a ne ua, a tate uh ha a zau hi, chih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng, Israel ah hiai paunak zat nawn chih na neikei ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, hinna tengteng kei avek ahi, pa hinna kei a a hih bangmah in tapa hinna leng kei a ahi: kha khial peuhmah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh mi a diktat a, siang leh dik a hih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mun sangte a nelou a, Israel inkawte milim lam nga samlou a, numei kizen lou leng naih lou a, kuamah tung a thil hihkhial lou a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />leibami thil khamna koih penawn zaw a, kuamah hiamgam a loklou a, gilkial kiang a nekding pia a, vuaktang puansilh sak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a pung delh ding a leitawi saklou a, a sumpung leng la sam lou a, thil gilou hihdia a khut kidek a, mi leh mi kikal a diktak a vaihawmsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka dan bawlte zui a, diktak a hih a, ka vaihawmnate a zuih leh, mi diktat ahi a, a hing ngei ding chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh tapa guktak ching a suan a, sisan suahmi a hih a, hiai bang a hih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hih ding zaw pen a hihlouh a, munsangte a a nek zawk a, invengte zi a hihbuah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Genthei leh tasamte a simmawh a, a loh a, a khamna koih a piak louh a, milimte lam a nga a, thil kihhuai a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pung delh a a piak a, apung a lakleh, a hing ding hia? A hing hetkei ding; hiai thil kihhuai tengteng a hihta a, a si ngeingei ding, amah sisan mawh a puak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, ngai in, tapa na nei tei taleh, a pa thil gilou hihsa tengteng a muh a, lau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang a hih teitei louh a, mun sang a a neklouh a, Israel inkawte milim lamte a ngatlouh a, invengte zi a hihnit louh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuamah tung a thil a hihkhelh louh a, khamna koih bangmah la lou a, kuamah lok lou a, gilkialte nekding pe zaw a, savuakte a silhsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Genthei lak a a khut a kidek sak a, a nou leh a pung lalou a, ka thupiakte zang a ka dan bawlte zuimi ahihleh, a pa thulimlouhna ziak in a si kei ding a, a hingzaw ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa bel kheltak a mi a nuaisiah a, a unaupa hiamgam a sual a, a mite lak a thil hoihlou a hih ziak in, ngai in, a thulimlouhna ziak in a si ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh, Bangdia tapa in a pa thulimlouhna thuaklou ding, na chi nak uh? Tapa in dan a zuih a thil kizen a hih a, ka dan bawl tengteng a zuih a, a hih lai leh, a hing ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kha khial a si ding: tapa in a pa thulimlouhna a thuak kei ding a, pa in leng tapa thulimlouhna a thuak sam kei ding; mi diktat diktatna amah mah tung ah a om ding, migilou gitlouhna amah mah tung ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh, migilou in a khelhna hih tengteng a lehngatsan a, ka dan bawlte a zuih a, dan zui a thil diktat ahihleh a hing ngei ding, a si kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tatlekna a na hihsa theihsak ahita kei ding: a na hihsa a diktatna ah a hing ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Migilou sihna ah kipahna ka nei ahia? A lampite a lehngatsan a, a hinna zaw pen lou? chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh mi diktat in a diktatna lampi a lehngatsan a, thulimlouhna a hih a, migiloute hih bangzel a thil kihhuaite a hih in a hing dia hia? A thil diktat hihsa bangpeuh leng theih gige ahi nawnta kei ding a, a tatlekna hih ah leh a khelhna hih ah, huai mahmah ah a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa hihdan a kibang gige kei hi, na chi sek uh. Israel inkawte aw, ngai un: ka hihdan a kibang gige kei maw? Na hihdan uh a kibang kei gige zaw ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi diktat in a diktatnate a lehngatsan a, thulimlouhnate ahihleh huai ah a si ding a, thulimlouhna a hih ah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huailou leng, migilou in a khelhna a hihsate lehngatsan a, dan a zuih a, thil diktat ahihleh a hinna a humbit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kingaihtuah a, a tatlekna a hihsa tengteng a lehngatsan ziak in a hing ngei ding, a si kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh Israel inkawte’n, Toupa hihdan a kibang gige kei, a chi uhi. Aw Israel inkawte aw, ka hihdante a kibang gige ahizaw kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nou hihdante bel a kibang kei gige zaw ahi kei maw? Huaiziak in, aw Israel inkawte aw, michih, noumau hihdan bangzel in vai k’on hawmsak ding a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi. Kihei unla, na tatlekna tengtengte uh lehngatsan un: huchi in thulimlouhna na puksiatna uh ahi kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na tatlekna tengteng uh, na tatleksate uh paimang vek unla, lungtang thak leh lungsim thak kibawl un: Bang ding in na si ding ua oi, aw Israel inkawte aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi sihna ah kipahna mahmah ka neikei a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi: huaiziak in kihei unla, hing un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailou in leng Israel heutute tungtang ah sunna la phuah ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nu bang ahia a hih? Humpinelkaipi ahi; humpinelkaite lak ah a kual a, humpinelkai lunlaite lak ah a noute a vaklian a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan a noute lak ah khat a vaktei a; humpinelkai lunlai a honghi: samat a siam a, mite a negai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Namte’n leng a tanchin a za ua: a kawkhuk uah mat in a om: huan Aigupta gam ah sikkawiin amah a pi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in a ngak a, a lametna a vuaksuak chih a theih in, a noute lak ah a khat a la a, humpinelkai lunlai in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Humpinelkai lak ah a paisuk paitou, humpinelkai lunlai a honghi: samat a siam a, mite a gai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A innpi sesate uh a thei a, a khopite uh a hihgawp a, gam a segawp a, a humham husa ziak in, huai a tengteng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in bialte a kipan in ningchih a namte’n amah a dou ua: a tung ah a len uh a zak ua; a kawkhuk uah mat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikkawite in bawm sung ah a koih ua; Babulon kumpipa kiang ah a pi ua; kulh muanhuaite sung ah a pi lut ua, huchi a Israel tangsangte tung a aw a kizak nawn louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na nu na sisan a grepgui bang ahi, tuite kiang a suan: tui tampite ziak in gahthei leh hiangte in a dim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan vaihawmna pawte lalchiang sikchiang khauh a nei in, nah bawk pha lak ah a sandan uh hihsang in a om hi, huchi in a hiang tampite utoh sangpi a muh in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh thangpaihna a bohkhiak in a om a, lei a paih in a om a, suahlam huih in a gah a mutkeu: a kung khauhte a kitan a, a keu; mei in a maute a kang beita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan tuin gamdai ah, gamkeu leh tui omlou ah phuh in a om,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a hiang a sikchiang apan mei a paikhia, a gah a hulbei a, huchi in amah ah vaihawm ding in lalchiang ding sikchiang khauh a omkei hi. Hiai kahla ahi, Kahla a ding a sak ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kum sagihna, kha ngana, huai kha ni sawm ni’n Israel Upa kuate hiam Toupa thu dong ding in a hongpai ua, ka ma ah a tu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel upate houpih inla, a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Kei thudong dia hongpai na hi uh hia? A hin a ka hin laiteng, noute thudot in ka omkei ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau na hawmsak kei dia hia? Mihing tapa, hawmsak tanla, a pate uh kihhuainate theisak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Israelte ka tel ni a Jakob inkawte telte kiang ah banzak hial a Aigupta gam a a kiang ua ka kitheihsak a, a kiang ua ka khut ka zak a, Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai ni a Aigupta gam a kipan pikhia a, amah adia gam kham, nawitui leh khuaizu a luanggam, gam tengteng a kilawmpen a pilut ding a ka khut ka zak ni’n a kiang uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Michih in na mit ua muh thil kihhuai paimang unla, Aigupta gam a milimte in kihihnin kei un, kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi hi, chi in ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh, ka tung ah a hel ua, hon limsak kei ua, michih in a mit ua muh thil kihhuaite leng a paimang kei ua, Aigupta milimte leng a lehngatsan sam kei uh: Huai ah a tung ua ka hehna lungdamsak ding in Aigupta gamsung ngei ah a tung uah ka hehna ka leihbaw kei na diam, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh, keimah min ziak in ka gamtang zawta a, a omna namte uh mitmuh in Aigupta gam a kipan pikhia in a kiang uah ka kitheisak a, huai namte mitmuh in ka min gensiat a a omlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Aigupta gam pawtsan ding in ka chita a, gamdai ah ka hon pilutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka dan bawlte amaute ka pia a, ka thugelhte ka ensak a, huai tuh min a zuih ua a hinna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huailou leng kei leh amaute kikal a chiamtehna ding in ka khawlnite amau ka pia a, kei Toupa , amaute koihtuampa ka hi chih a theihtheihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Israel inkawte gamdai ah ka tung ah a hel ua, ka danbawlte a zuikei ua, ka thugelte, min a hih a a hinna dingtak uh a paikhia ua, ka khawlni nakpitak in a bohsia ua; Huchi in gamdai ah amau hihmang ding in ka hehna a tung uah ka leih keina diam aw, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pikhiak lai in a theimite nam mahmah mitmuh a hihsiat a a omlouhna ding un ka min ziak in ka gamtang zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huailou in huai gamdai ah ka gam piak, nawitui leh khuaizu a luang gam, gam tengteng a kilawmpen ah ka pilut kei ding, banzak hial in ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thugelhte a paikhia ua, ka dan bawlte a zuikei ua, ka khawlnite a bohsiat ziak un: a lungtang un a milimte uh a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh hihmanglou ding in ka mit in a muh maihta a, gam ah leng ka hihmang vekta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan gamdai ah a tate uh kiang ah, Na pate uh dan bawl zuikei unla, a thugelte uh zuikei unla, a milimte un kihihnin sam kei un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hia, ka dan bawlte zui unla, ka thugelte vom unla, zui un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka khawlni tang unla, kei leh noute kikal a chiamtehna ahi ding a, Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi chih na theihna ding un ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh a tate uh ka tung ah a hel ua, ka dan bawlte a zuikei ua, ka thugelte, min a hih a a hinna ding tak, zui ding in a vom sam kei uh; khawlni a bohseta ua; Gamdai ah ka hehna lungdamsak ding in a tung uah ka hehna ka leih kei na hiam ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh ka khut ka kideksak a, ka pikhiak lai a theimite nam ngei mitmuh a hihsiat a a omlouhna ding un ka min ziak in ka gamtang zawta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huailou leng, namte lak ah amau ka dalhsak ding a, gamchih ah ka thelthang sak ding, gamdai ah banzak hial in ka na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka thugelte a zuikei ua, ka dan bawlte a paikhia ua, ka khawlni a bohsia ua, a pate uh milim lam a ngat ziak un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huailou leng, dan bawl hoihlou ka pia a, a hin louhna ding ua thugelte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thiltan uh, sul hong tengtengte’n mei a a paihna uah amaute ka hihnin a, ka lungzuang sak a, a tawp a Toupa ka hi chih a theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaiziak in mihing tapa, a kiang uah thu gen inla, a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Na pate un hiaite ah a hon gense lailai uh ahi, ka tung a tatlekna thil ahihte uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Banzak hial a amaute ka chiam gam ah k’on pilut in, tang sang leh singbuk lian a muh peuhmah uah a kithoihnate uh a lan ua, a thillat uh hehhuai mahmahte a pia uh. A gimlimte uh a bawl ua, a dawn ding thillatte uh a bungkhia uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in ken a kiang uah, munsang a na hohnak uh bang na chihna uh ahia? ka chi a; huchi in a min ading in tunitan in, Bamah, chih ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in Israel inkawte kiang ah gen inla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Na pate uh bangzel in noumau na kihihnin un a kihhuaina bang un hupmang na hi ding uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na thil tan uh na lan un, na tate uh mei ah na pai ua, tunitan in na milimte tengteng un na kihihnin uh ahi kei maw? Noute thudot ding ka hi ahia, aw Israel inkawte aw? A hin a ka hin laiteng noute thudot in ka omkei ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />I kim ua namdang pautuam mite bang a singbul suangbul be ding i hi uh, na lungsim un na chi ua, na hi hetkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng, khut thagui hattak in, banzak kawm leh heh suah in na tung uah vai ka hawm ngeingei ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Namte lak a kipan k’on pikhe ding a, dalhsak a na omna gam ua kipan khut hattak leh banzak leh hehsuah in k’on pikhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pau tuam mite gamdai gam ah k’on pilut ding a, ki maituah in i kisual ding uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aigupta gam gamdai a na pate uh ka sual bangtak in nou leng k’onsual ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chiang nuai ah k’on lutsak ding a, thukhun delhkhumna nuai ah k’on pilut ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huan na lak ua kipan mihelte leh ka tung a talekmite ka khuahsiang ding a, a omna gam ua kipan in ka pikhe ding a, himahleh Israel gam ah a lut hetkei ding uh: huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Noute ahihleh, Aw Israel inkawte aw, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ka thu na ngaihkhiak kei uleh tunung chiang in na milim na uh semchiat maita unla; himahleh ka min siangthou bel na thilpiakte uleh na milimte un na hihninta kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka tang siangthou, Israel sanna tang ah, huai ah Israel inkawte tengteng in avek un, huai gam ah ka na a sem ding uh; huai ah amaute ka pakta tadia, huai ah na thillatte uh na thilpiak hoih tatate uh, na thil tan tengteng uh ka deihta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Namte lak a kipan k’on lakkhiak hun chiang in leh gamchih a na dalhna ua kipan k’on pikhawm hun chiang in, gimlim ding in noute k’on sangta ding a, namte mitmuh in noute ah ka sianthou dan a langta ding, Toupa Pathian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huan Israel gam, banzak hial a na pate uh piak ka chiam gam a noute k’on pilut hun chiang in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huan huai ah na omdante uleh na thilhih uh, na kihihnitna tengteng uh na theita ding uh; huchi in na thil hoihlou hih tengtengte uh ziak in noute mitmuh ngei in na kihta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na omdan hoihloute uh bang hilou a, na thilhih uh thulimloute bang leng hi samlou a, ka min ziak a noute k’on pichinsak hun chiang in, aw Israel inkawte aw, Toupa ka hi chih na theita ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mihing tapa, simlam masuan inla, simlam nga in na thukhah inla, simlam gammangpi lam ah thu gen inla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />simlam gammangpi kiang ah, Toupa thu ngai in, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in, nang ah mei ka toh ding a, nang a sing hing tengteng a kang bei ding a, sing keu peuhmah leng: mei kuang luahluah a dai kei ding, sim a kipan a mal tan in, matuah teng a kangvom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huan mi tengteng in kei Toupa meikhahpa ka hi chih a mu ding ua, a mit kei ding, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huchi in ken, “Ah! Toupa Pathian, Gentehna thugenmi lel ahi a honchi kei dia” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Jerusalem maituah inla, a Mun Siangthou lam nga in na thu gen inla, Israel gam tung ah thu gen in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel gam kiang ah, huchi in Toupa’n a chi ahi: Ngai in, ka hondou ahi, ka namsau a pai a kipan ka phawi ding a, na lak ua mi diktat leh diktatlou kibang sap in ka phuk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in na lak ua mi diktat leh diktatlou ka phuk ding ziak in ka namsau a pai a kipan a pawt ding a, simlam a kipan mallam pha in mihing tengteng a phuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in, mi tengteng in, kei Toupa’n ka namsau a pai a kipan ka phawi ahi chih a thei ding uh, a kikhum ngei nawnta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in nang mihing tapa, thum huthut inla khasetak in a mit muh un thum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, “Bangdia thum na hia?” a hon chih uleh, “Thu thang ziak in ahi, a hongtung sin ngal a, huai hun in lungtang chiteng a zul ding a, khut tengteng a zaw ding a, lungsim teng a bah ding a, khuk tengteng tui bang in a zaw ding a; ngai in, a hongtung hi, a tangtun ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a: ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihing tapa, thu gen inla, huchi in Toupa’n a chi ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namsau, namsau tat-hiam ahita, tetsak ahita, mi satna ding a tat-hiam ahita, tetsak ahi, khophia bang in! I nuamsa lailai ding maw? ka tapa, chiang na simmawh, sing a bawl peuhmah toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetsak ahi, leh ding in ahi namsau tat-hiam tetsak ahi, thatmi khut a tuang ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing tapa, kikou inla; sehal ham inla, ka mite tung ahi ngal a; Israel mi liante teng tung mahmah: piak ahi ua, ka mite toh, namsau nuai ah; huaiziak in kikou inla, na pheipi beng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai namsau midang tung a chiamtehsa ahi ngal a, na ngaihsak kei hita leh bang suak ding chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in nang, mihing tapa, khut beng hial in thu gen in; thah a om dingte ading namsau nihvei liksuk in om hen, ahi, thumvei; tampi thahna ding namsau ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungtang zul, a pukna uh a punna ding in, namsaute kong biang teng ah ka giaksak hi; Ah! khophia bang in a te zolzol, sihna namsau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nakpi’n gamtang in, taklam ah, gamtang in veilam ah leng van zel inla, na mazawn peuhmah ah leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ken leng khut ka beng ding a, ka tangtun ngei ding, ka hehna, kei Toupa’n hiai ka genta hi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Babulon kumpipa namsau hongtun theihna ding in lampi nih nabawl in; huai lampi nihte gam khat a kipan in a hong pawtkhe ding uh ahi: lampi kawkmuhna bawl inla, khopi lutna khomual ah bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lampi Ammon mite khua Rabath namsau hongtunna ding in sep inla, Judah gamlai Jerusalem kulh ah leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aisan ding in Babulon kumpipa lampi ka ah ading a, lampi nih kigawmna tak ah; thalte a sing loklok a terephim a dong a, sa sin a en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A aisanna ah a khut taklam ah Jerusalem a na tuang a, kulh suksiatnate galsual awng zuazuate, kongpi zawn a kulh suksiatnate, mual pawng sunte, kulh bawlte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aisan vuaksuak lel bang ahi a, himahleh mat a a omna ding ua a thulimlouhna uh theihkhiakna lel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: na thulimlouhna uh theihgigena dia na bawl ziak un na tatleknate uh a hong kilang, na thilhih tengteng uah na khelhnate uh a kimu kilkel a, theihkhiak na hong hihtak ziak un khut a mat na honghi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan, nang, Israel heutu, migilou si ding a liampa, na gitlouhna gawtna tawp ni a hongtung e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Heutu lukhu paihsak unla, lallukhu suhsak un, hiai a ngei in a omkei ding: mi vuallelte tawisang unla, mi liante vuallel sak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka lumlet ding, ka lumlet ding, ka lumlet ding; hiai leng a ngei in a omkei ding, a neimi tak ding a hongpai mateng amah ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan nang mihing tapa, thu gen inla, hichi in chi in: Toupa Pathian in Ammon tate tungtang ah leh a gensiatna thu uah hichi in a chi ahi: Namsau, namsau phawi ahita, mi thahna ding leh hihmanna ding khophia bang a tetsak ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kilakna taklou nang a hon musak ua, zuau in ai a hon sansak ua, Namsau bel migilou si ding a liam, a gitlouhna ni uh tawp hongtung dingte ngawng ah na golh ding, a honchih un a zuau uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A pai ah thun in, Na pianna siam a na omna gam ngei ah na thu ka ngaihtuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na tung ah ka hehna ka sung dia, ka thangpaihna mei na tung ah ka toh ding, mi nunse tak, hihman siamtak khut ah k’on mansak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mei a khul ding na hi ding a, gamlai ah na sisan a baw ding a, theih mahmah na hita kei ding, kei Toupa’n ka genta ngal a, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang mihing tapa, sisan suahhat khopi na langsin ahia? Na langsin ahia? A kihhuaina tengteng theisak dihve:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: khopi, a hun hongtunna ding a amah sung a sisan suah leh amah kihihnin ding a milim bawl:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sisan suahna ah mawhna na pua a, na milim bawl ah na kihihnin ahi; na hunte na naisaka, na kumte na tung phialphiala; huaiziak in namte kiang ah gensiat ding leh gam tengteng engbawl ding in k’on bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na naih a mi leh na gamlata mite’n a hon simmawh ding ua, nang, minsiat pua leh buaina a dim mi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, Israel heutute michih in a thilhihtheihna bangzel ua sisan suah mai ding in nangmah ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ah min nu leh pate a musit ua, nang ah mikhualte a nuaisiah ua, nang ah tagahte leh meithaite a mawkbawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thiltante na musit a, ka khawlnite na bohsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang ah sisan suah ding in mi hekhatte a om ua, nang ah tangsang a nete a om ua, nang ah hukna a ching uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang ah a pate uh vuaktanna lemsak a om ua, nang ah numei kizenlouh lai luppih a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan min a inveng zi tung ah thil kihhuai a hih a, midang in huktak in a mou a hihnin a, midang in nang ah a sanggamnu, a pa tanu ngei a zahlaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang ah sisan suah ding in golhna a la ua, a nou leh a pung na la a; na inveng nuaisiah in huaihamtak in na lepguksak hi; kei mahmah leng n’on mangngilh a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai in, na lepgukna thu ah, nang a sisan pawt thu ah khut k’on betkhum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang k’on sual ni chiang in na lungtang in a thuakzou in na khut a hat thei diam maw? Kei Toupa ngei in ka genta a, ka hihlai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan nam lak ah k’on hihdalh ding a, gamchih ah k’on thehzak ding; nang a kipan in na nitnate ka hihmang vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namte mitmuh in nangmah kihihnin na hi ding, huan, Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel inkawte ei ading in eksia lel a hong hita ua; avek un haltuina meilai ah dalte, langvate, sikte, suante ahi uh, dangkasik eksia lel ahita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Eksia lel na hong hih ziak un, ngai un, Jerusalem lai ah k’on khawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dangkasikte, dalte, sikte, suante, langvate haltuina mei a a koihkhawm ua, tuisak ding a a tung a mei a toh bang un ka hehna leh ka thangpaihna ah nou k’on khawm ding, huai ah k’on koih ding a, k’on tuisak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, k’on khawm ding a, na tung uah ka hehna mei ka toh ding a, a lai ah na tuikhin ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Haltuina mei lai a dangkasik a tui bang in nou leng, huai lai ah na tuikhin ding uh, kei Toupa’n na tung uah ka hehna ka sung ahi chih na theita ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, a kiang ah gen inla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gam khuahsiang louh hehna ni chia vuahtui tanglou na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Humpinelkai in humham a samat a zong bang mai in nang ah zawlnei sawmnate a om ahi: mi hinnate a nekhin ua, goute leh thil manphate a laksak ua, a lai ah meithai tampi a bawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A siampute leng nakpitak in ka dan ah a talek ua, ka thil tante a hihnin uh ahi, thiltante leh thil namai a khen kei ua, mite lah thil siangthou leh siangthou lou a khentuan kei uh; ka khawlnite a kitheihmohbawl ua, a lak uah hih minsiat in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lai a heutute lah nge duhgawl nekding zong banglel ahi ua, sisan suah a mi hinnate hihmang in ginomlou tak a a lep theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan, a zawlneite’n sunu in bang a nuh ua, kilakna bangmahlou lel a mu ua, zuau in ai a san ua, Toupa’n bangmah a genlouh in leng, “ Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gam a mipite’n nuaisiah a ching ua, loh a hat ua, ahi, mi genthei leh tasamte a mawkbawl ua, dikloutakin mikhualte a nuaisiah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gam ka hihsiat louhna ding in a lak ua daikai ding leh gamhuma ka ma a pang ding mi ka zong a, ka mu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huaiziak in a tung uah ka hehna ka sungbawta a, ka thangpaihna mei in ka halmangta ahi; a omdan ngei uh a tung uah ka tungsak ahi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, numei nih, nu khat ta a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah a hukmang ua, a tuailai neu ua huk ahi ua, huai ah a angnem uh a zawtsak ua, a tuailai nawi uh a meksak ek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khat, a upapen min Aholah ahi a, a sanggamnu bel Aholibah ahi; kei a a hong hita ua, tapate tanute a suang ua. A min uh, Aholah Samaria ahi a; Aholibah bel Jerusalem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan Aholah kei a a hih nung in a hukmang nawn a, a deihtak, invengte, Assuria a nou a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ukpipate, vaihawmmite, tangval iplahhuai mahmah ngen, sakol tungtuang mi, puan sandup a kizemte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai Assuria tangval hoihte tengteng lak ah a kiphalvek ua, a etlahte milim tengteng in a kihihnin nawn behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tuailai neu a kipan a nawite a meksak uh leh a luppih ziak un Aigupta a kipan in a huk a tawp tuankei a, amau leng a hukna uh a tung uah a hih piching uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A deihtakte, Assuria, a nouhnouhte khut ngei ah ka mansak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiaite’n a vuaktanna a lemdawk ua, a tanu leh a tapate a laksak ua, amah leng namsau in a that ua, numeite lak ah a kikhemlauna pen uh a hong hita, a tung a gel bang a mualsuahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan a sanggamnu Aholibah in hiai a mu a, himahleh a u sang in a deihtak nouhnouhna ah a uangzaw in, a hukna a uang semsem lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Assuria mi, invengte gam ukpipa leh vaihawmpa tangval etlahhuaitak ngen, sakol tungtuangmi, kilawmtaka kivante a nounou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hihnit in a om chih ka mu a, a nih un lam kibang a tawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a huknate a uangsak sem a, pasal lim bang a tuang, Kaldai mite lim, sanau tak a kizem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kawng ah kawnggak a gak a, dial kilawm tak khim in, avek ua milian bang in, Kaldai gam, a pianna gam ua Babulon mite bangtakte a muh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau a muhtak in a nounou a, a kiang uah Kaldai pha in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Babulon mite a kiang ah, kingaihna lupna ah a hongpai ua, a hukna un a hihnin ua, a kihih kihhuai khinta ua, amau amah a nel mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in a hukna a hihlang a, a vuaktanna a lemsak a, a sanggamnu’n a honnel bang in aman leng a honnelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh a tuailai a Aigupta gam a a huklai a theihgige ziak in a huktuan semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A angkawmpihte van, sabiltung a bang mai ahi a, a thilpawtte leng, sakolte a thilpawt bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchibang in na tuailai hukna Aigupta min na tuailai nawite a hon khoihsak lai na theikhe nawnta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in, aw Aholibah, hichibang in Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi; Ngai in, nang hon it, na lungsim in a nelsate ka tamsak ding a, kilchih a kipan ka pikhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babulon mite leh Kaldai mi tengteng, Pekodte, Shoate, Koate leh a kiang ua Assuria mi tengteng toh; tangval etlahhuai taktakte, ukpipate, vaihawmmite, avek un mi liante leh minthangte, avek un sakol tung tuang in a hongpai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Galvante, kidouna kangtalaite, kangtalaite leh mipi omkhawmin a hongsual ding ua; lum lian leh lum neu, dal lukhute toh na kim ah a hon um ding ua; a kiang uah vaihawmna ka kemsak ding a, a thugel bangzel un na tung ah a hih tangtung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan na tung ah ka lunghihlouhna ka tungsak ding a, heh mahmah in nang a honsual ding ua, na nakte leh na bilte a tan ding ua, a damsunte namsau in a si ding uh, na tanu leh na tapate a hon laksak ding ua, a damsunte mei in a kanglum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na puansilhte a hon hawksaklai ding ua, na kizepna kilawm taktakte a lamang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na hukna leh Aigupta gam a kipan a na kizuakna a hon tawpsak ding ua, huchi in amau lam ah na mit na lengsak nawn keidia, Aigupta gam na theigige nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ngal a: Ngai in, na huat mahmah, nang hon chimtakte khut mahmah ah k’on mansak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huat petmah in a honhaw ding ua, na sepgim gah tengteng a hon laksak ding ua, vuaktang in kihawmkhai in a hon taisan ding uh; na kizuakna vuaktanna, na hukna leh na kizuakna ngei hihlat in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hiai thilte na tung ah a hongtung ding, namdangte delh in na hukmang ding a, a milimte ua na kihihnit ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na sanggamnu lampi na tawn sam a, huaiziak in amah nou na khut ah ka honpe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Na sanggamnu nou thuk leh lian na dawn ding a, nuihsan leh simmawh in na om ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khamna leh lungkhamna’n na dim dia, lamdangsakna leh siatna nou, na sanggamnu Samaria nou toh na dawn gai keuhkeuh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na dawn ding a, a nou leng na tawpsiang vek ding; na sam na botkhe dia, na nawite na ham kek ding; Kei, Toupa Pathian in ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: N’on mangngilh a n’on na dal ziak in na hukna leh na kizuakna mawh na paw mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huailou leng Toupa’n ka kiang ah a gen nawn a, Mihing tapa, Aholah leh Aholibah na langsin ahia? A kihhuaina uh a kiang uah phuang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ang a kawmta ua, sisan a khut uah a bang a, a milim kiang ah ang a kawmta uhi; a tapate uh kei adia a suan uh a kiang ua kangmang ding in mei ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huailou in leng, ka kiang ah hiai a chi uh ahi; amau mah in ka Mun Siangthou a hihnin ua, ka khawlnite leng a bohsia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A milimte uh adia a tate uh a thah nung un, amau mah in ka Mun Siangthou hihnin ding in a lut ua; ngai in, hichibang in ka inn sung mahmah ah a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huailou leng, gamlapi a mi hong ding in na thukhak ua, mi na sawl ua, ngai in, a hong ua, amau hel in na kisilsiang a, na mit na nuh a, kizephoihna dangte na silh a, lupna thupi tak ah na tu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A ma ah dohkan na bawl a, ka gimlim leh ka sathaute huai ah na lui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huai ah mipi nuamtal husa zak ahi a, mi namai kia lou leng gamdai a kipan in zukhamte a honpi ua, a nih un taute a bun ua, lukhu kilawmte a khu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huan ken, Angkawmnu tek nung a kithuahpih nuam sin un aman a ngap peuhmah diam maw? ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchi in kizuak kiang a a hoh bang un a kiang ah a lutta thou ua; huchi in numei huk Aholah leh Aholibah kiang ah a lutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Himahleh mi diktatte’n angkawmnute leh sisan suahhat numeite vai a hawm bang un a hawm sak ding ua, angkawmnute a hih ua, a khut ua sisan a ban ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Na tung uah mipi ka kaikhawm ding a, k’on loksak ding a, k’on bawlsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mihonte’n suang in a deng ding ua, a namsau un a satlum ding ua, a tanute uh, a tapate uh a that ding ua, a innte uh a halsak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hichibang in hukna gam a kipan ka hihmang ding a, numei tengteng in na hukna uh chin louh hial ding ahi chih na theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huchi in na tung uah na hukna uh a honthuk ding ua, na milim khelhnate uh na thuak ding uh, kei Toupa Pathian ka hi chih na thei ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum kua na, kha sawmna, huai kha, ni sawm ni’n Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, tuni ni min ngei gelh in; hiai ni in Babulon kumpipa’n Jerusalem a hongsual pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan helhat Inkawte kiang ah gentehna thu gen inla, a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sa uina bel suang inla, suang nilouh inla, a sung ah tui sung inla: sabakte kha inla, a sa hoih tengteng, a pheite, a liangte, a guhbawk hoih tata in hihdim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gan honte lak a a hoih tata la inla, a nuai ah singkhuah khul ek inla, sou bolhbolh hen; ahi, a guhbomte ki ui hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Sisan suahhat khopi, sa ui bel, a sung kanggem, a gem daingei nailou a tung a gik hi: tel tuanlou in, a sa bak khatkhat in thuk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sisan suah amah tung ah a om a, leivui vuh theihna dia lei a sunbuak gentak louh in suangpi keu tung ah a sungbaw zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phula ding a hehna a hong kisak theihna ding in vuh louh in a sisan suah suangpi keu tung ah ka sung ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Sisan suahhat khopi a tung a gik hi: Kei mahmah in ka vum venvon ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sing vum venvon unla, mei chihsa unla, sate ui min unla, satui chiktak in, a guhte leng kangmang hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in bel a vuak in meivu tung ah suan hi nilouh henla, a hongsa ding a, a dal a hong am ding a, a nitna a hongzul mang ding, a kangkhem a katmang theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chimtak khop a sual in leng a kangkhem a siang tuankei a, mei in leng a kang siang sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nitna hukna ahi a, k’on khuah a, na sian tuanlouh ziak in na tung ah ka hehna ka lungdamsak mateng chikmah chiang in na nitna a kipan khuahsiang na hi nawnta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei Toupa’n ka chita ahi, a hongtung mahmah ding, ken ka hih ding, ka nungkin kei ding a, ka hawi sam kei ding a, ka lunghei sam kei ding; na omdante leh na thilhih bangzel in vai a hon hawmsak ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing tapa, ngai in, thakhat in na mit taina pen k’on laksak ding a, na sun ding ahi kei dia, na kah ding leng ahi sam kei, na khitui leng a kiak ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sim in thum inla, misi sunna nei ken, na dial khim inla, na khedap bulh inla, na muk hum kenla, mite an leng ne ken, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in zingsang lam in mipite kiang ah thu ka gen a, nitaklam in ka zi a si maimah a; zingsang lam in a hon thupiak bang in ka hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite’n ka kiang ah, hichibang na thilhihte kou ding in bang ahia a hih na honhilh kei dia hia? a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in ken a kiang uah, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel inkawte kiang ah gen inla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: ngai un, ka Mun Siangthou, na hatna suan pen uh, na mittaina pen uh, na deihlam pen uh ka hihnin ding hi; na tanute uh; na tapate uh, nunglam a na nutsiatte uh namsau in a puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hih bang geih in na hihtei ding uhi; na muk uh na hum kei ding ua, mite an leng na ne sam kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na dialte uleng na khim ding ua, na khedap uh na bun ding ua: na sun kei ding ua, na kap sam kei ding ua, na thulimlouhnate uah na mangthang ding ua, na kikah tuah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichibang in Ezekiel nou ading in etsakna ahi ding a, a hihdan bangzel in na hih ding uh ahi: hiai a hongtun hun chiang in Toupa Pathian ka hi chih na thei ding uh, chi ahi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan, nang mihing tapa, amau a kipan a hatnate uh, a thupi kipahnate uh, a mittaina pente uh, a lunglutnapente uh, a tanu uleh a tapate uh ka lakmang ni chiang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai ni mahmah chiang in a taikhia na kiang a hongpai ding a, a hong theisak kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in taikhe kiang ah na kam na ka ding a, a kiang thu na gen ding a, na dai maimah kei ding; huchi in amau ading in etsakna na hi ding a; huchi in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Ammon tate masuan inla, a tungtang thu uh gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon tate kiang ah, Toupa Pathian thu ngaikhia unla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: ka Mun Siangthou hihnit a om a, Israel gam hihgawp a a om a, Judah Inkawte sal a pi a omlai ua, Awi ing e: Numei: na chihziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, suahlam mite kiang ah a hontan ding un k’on pe ding ahi; nang ah buk a koih ding ua, nang ah tenna a bawl ding uh; na theigahte a ne ding ua, na nawitui a dawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rabah khua sangawngsau inn ding in ka bawl dia, Ammon tate mun ganhon kualna mun ding in ka bawl ding; huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Israel gam tung a na khut na bet a, na khe na pek a, lungsim tengteng a a siatna tung a na kipah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, na tung ah ka khut ka lik ding a, namte kiang ah gallak ding in k’on mansak ding a; mite a kipan k’on phuk ding a, huai gam a kipan in k’on hihmang vengveng ding, k’on hihse ding a, huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Moab leh Seir in, Ngai in, Judah Inkawte namdang bang ahi uh, a chih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab pang khat, khopite lampang, gamgi zul a khopi, a gam thupina pente, Bethzeshimotte, Baal meonte, Kiriathaimte lampang ka hong ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suahlam tate tan ding in Ammon tate toh kape ding a, Ammon tate namte lak a theih gige a hih nawnlouhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab gam tung ah thu gel ka tangtung sak ding a, huchi in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi a: Edom in Judah inkawte tung a phuba la in nakpitak in thil a hihkhial hi, amah thu kia a a tung ua phu a lak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Edom tung ah ka khut kalik ding a, a lak ua kipan mi leh sate ka phukmang vek ding; Teman a kipan in ka hihgawp ding a; Dedan pha in namsau in a si ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in ka mi Israelte khut in ka phulakna ka tungsak ding a, Edom tung ah ka hehna bangzel leh ka thangpaihna bangzel in a hih ding ua, ka phulakna a na thei ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Philistia mite’n phula a, tangtawn kimelmakna a, mi hihman utna lungsim sia pu a phu a lak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi, ngai in, Philistia mite tung ah ka khut kalik ding a, Kareth khomite ka phukvek ding a, tuigei a mi omsunte ka hihmang vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, heh mahmah in sal in a tung uah phu ka la ding a, huchi a a tung ua ka phulakna ka tunsak hun chiang in Toupa ka hi chih a theita ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawm leh khatna kha, ni masapen in hichi ahi a, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Tura in Jerusalem tungthu a, Nuam e, Namte kongkhak a seta, keilam ah a kihong, hih siatgawp a a omvek ziak in, katan hoih ding ahita, a chih ziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ngai in, aw Tura, k’on dou ahi, tuipi in a kihot a voktou bang mai in na tung a hongpai ding in nam tampi k’on sawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Tura kulhte a hihse ding ua, a insangte a chimsak ding ua, amah a kipan leivui tengteng ka kheuhsiang ding a, suangpi keu lel in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuilai a len phoukeuna mun ahimai ding, ken ka chita ngal a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi; huchi in namte adin gallak ahi mai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan a tanu gam a omte namsau a hihlup a hih chiang un Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngai in, Tura tung ah Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar, Kumpipate kumpipa mallam a kipan in, sakolte toh sakol tung tuangmite, a pawl leh mipi tampi mahmah ka honpi dek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam ah namsau in na tanute a that ding; kulh a bawl ding a, nang nanna ding in, nang douna ding in a bawl ding, mual pawngte, nang douna kidalna a bawlkhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulhsuksiatna a bawl, na kulh phelna ding, na insang a chimsak ding, heipi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sakol tam ziak in a hontuam ding, leivui in, khopi siat a mite a lutsek bang in, na kongpi a honglut hun chiang un, na kulhpi a ling ding a, sakol tungtuangte husa leh kidou kangtalai husa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sakol khechin in a chilse ding, na kongzingte; na mite a thatkhin ding, namsau in; na hatna bangbang lei ah a chim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na gouthil gallak in a la ding ua; na van tengteng a gubei ding uh; na kulhbang lei ah a chimsak ding ua, na Inpi nuam a hihse vek ding uh, na suangte, na singte, na leivuite tuilai ah a pai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka khawlsak khin ding a, na lasak husate, na kaihging leng a daiden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suangpi keu lel in k’on bawl ding a, len phoukeuna ding na honghi ding hi, dinsak nawn na hi kei ding, kei Toupa’n ka chita ngal a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in Tura khua kiang ah hichi in a chi a, na sung a kithahnate a om hun a, miliamte a thum hun chiang in na puk ging in tuipi gei gamte a ling kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipi tung a heutute tengteng a tutphah ua kipan a paisuk ding ua, a puan thupite uh a koih ding ua, a puansilh zephoihte uh a suahta ding ua; linna in a kivan zawta ding ua, lei ah a tu ding ua, a lingling ding ua, lamdang a honsa ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in nang sunna la a phuak ding ua, na kiang ah, Khopi minthang, tuipi tung a hat, tui siam mitengteng tenna sek, amah leh asung a tengte tengteng, mi vialvakte’n a honlauh lauh utoh, na siatna thupi hina tele:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pukna ni’n a ling uh, tuikulh gamte; tuipi tuikulh a lunglel ua, na man ni’n, a chi ding uh chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi, khopi gam, kuamah luahlouh khopi bang a k’on bawl hun chiang in, tui thukpi ah k’on tumsak ding a, tui thupi mahmah in a hontum ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leinuai lam ah, nidang a segawpsa, khuk thuk a paisate kiang ah k’on tengsak ding a, kuamah in a hon luahlouhna ding un leh mihingte lak a thupina na muh nawn hetlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />K’on hihmang vengveng ding a, na om nawnta kei ding, min honzong mahle uleng, a hon munawnta kei ding uh chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang, mihing tapa, Tura khaw sunna la phuak inla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tura khua kiang ah, Aw nang tuipi gei a tengsek, tuipi gei gam tampite kiang a sumsin, Toupa Pathian in huchi in a honchi ahi: Aw nang Tura, ka kilawm bukim na chi maw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gam in tuipi lai a sun hi, nang hon bawlte’n hon kilawm tungtuan sak mah ve ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na singzat Senir meilah in a bawl ua; na longpeu ding in, Lebanon a sidar in a bawl uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bashan tosaw na longzapna ding in a bawl ua; Saiha suang phum na long pialkhang ding in, tak sing tuipi gam Kupra a kipan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na long puanzak Aigupta puanmalngat gial, nang chiamtehna ding in a natung hi, nang dia limzak dumpuang, sandup, Elishah tui gei a kipan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na longkalmi Sidon, Arvad mi ahi; na long hawlmite leng Zemir misiamte ahi ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gebal upa leh mi khutsiam, na long bulhtuahmite ahi ua, tuipi long teng leh a mite’n, nang hong dawl ding in a hongzuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na galdoumi, na sepaihhon, Persia, Lud, Put mite ahi ua, a lum uh leh a dal lukhu uh na bang ah a khai ua, nang kilawmsakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na sepaih hon leh Arvadmite’n na kulhpi kimvel in a veng ua, Gammadim mite’n na insang a veng ua, a lum uh a bang ua, na kulhpi kimvel in a khai uh a, nang kilawmsakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hauh ziak in, sum leh pai gou thil chiteng, Tarshish nang hon dawlmi a honghi a, na van lei in a honlam hi, dangkasik, sik, langva, leh a suante leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zavan, Tubal, Meshek, nang hon dawlte’n sal leh dal tuium-belsuan in a hondawl ua, na van neihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Togarmah a mite’n sakol, kidouna sakol leh sabiltung in na van a lei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dedan mite nang hondawl mite ahi ua, tuigei munchih na sumsinna mun a honghi, saiha leh eboni a hon puak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van na hauh ziak in, Edom nang hondawl a honghi a, emerald suang, puansandup, puanzep, puanmalngat, khibah, agate suangte in nang a hondawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah leh Israel teng nang hondawlte ahi ua, Minnith buh leh Pannag, khuaizu, sathau leh singnai in a hondawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na hauh ziak in, sum leh pai gou thil chiteng, Damaska nang hondawl a honghi a, Helbon uain leh belam mulkang in a hondawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzal uain hontawi in a lei ua, na vante, sikseksa, singguithak leh kawltute na sumsinna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sakol tungphah puante in Dedan in nang a hondawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arabia leh Kedar kumpipate nang hondawlte ahivek uh, Belamnoute, belamtalte, keltalte in a hondawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sheba leh Raamah sumsinmite nang hondawlte a honghi ua, gimlim hoihpente, suangmantam chichih leh dangkaengte in, nang a hondawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran, Kanneth leh Eden, Sheba, Assuria leh Kilmad sumsinmite nang hondawlte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaite ahi uh, nang hondawl, puansilh hoih chi, puandum buang, puanzep, pialkhang phah ze kilawm toh, khauhual chiptak a hek in, hiaite in nang hondawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tarsish longhon leh longlian vanpawte ahi ua, Na hong inbul in tuipi tung ah na hong thupita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na long hawlpa’n tuipi kihot ah a hon hawllut a, suahlam huih in nang a hon nuaimang, tuipi lai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na hauhsakna, na van, na sumsinna thil, na longmite, longhawlmi, bulhtuakmite, sumsin van khengmite, na galbawl mite tengteng, nang a om, na sung a om tengteng toh, na siat ni’n tuipi lai ah na tummang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na longhawlmite kikou husa in na kim a mite a ling uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Longkalhna peu lenmite tengteng, longmite leh, tuipi a hawlmite tengteng paisuk in, ading ua, luipiau ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tungthu ah a aw uh zak tham in a suah ding ua, khasetak in a kap ding ua; a lu ua leivuite buak in, vut lak ah a kitholh ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang ziak in kimet giau in, saiip puan a teng ding ua; khase lua in nakpitak a kap in nang a honsun ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang hon sun in kahla a sam ding ua, nang sun in Tura bang khopi kua a om a, amah tuipi lai ah, Dai sipsip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na vante’n tuipi a pan pawt in mi tampi a vak kham sek; na dangka leh na van in lei kumpipate na hausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuipi thuk a na siat ni’n, na sumsinna thil, na mite, nang toh a thelthang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tui gei a teng mitengteng in mulkimhuai a honsa ua; a kumpipate uh lau in a sibup ua, a mel uh a lamdang hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mite lak a sumsinmite’n nang a hon khoisat khum ua, mite ading in launa na hongsuakta hi; Na kilang nawn ngeikei dia leh, chi in a hon kahkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa Pathian thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Tura heutupa kiang ah gen inla, Toupa Pathian in, hichi in a chi: Na lungsim a kisathei a, Pathian ka hi a, tuipi lai a Pathian tutmun ah ka tu, na chi a: himahleh mihing lel na hi a, pathian na hi kei a, pathian lungsim bang in kingaihtuah mahle chin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daniel sang in na pil zaw a, nalak ah thuguk a om theikei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na pilna leh na lemtheihna in nana kihih hau a; na goubawm ah dangka leh dangkaeng na khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pilna thupi mahmah leh na sumsaina in sum na hihpunga; na hauhsak ziak in na lungsim a na kisatheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi a; Pathian lungsim bang pu a na kingaihtuah ziak in, ngai in, pautuam mi, nam lauhuai tak na kiang ah k’on sawl sin ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pilna gah kilawm tung ah a namsau uh a lek ding ua, na thupina a hihse ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuk thuk ah a hon sawllut ding ua, tuipi lai a a thahte uh sih in na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang hon thatmi ma ah, Pathian ka hi, na chi lailai dia hia? Nang hon liamsakmi khut ah pathian na hi kei a, mihing lel na hizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pautuam mite khut ah, zeksumlou sih in na si ding; ka pauta ngal a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huailou leng Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Tura kumpipa sunna la phuak inla, a kiang ah, Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi: Hoih buchingtak, pilna a dim, kilawmna chiteng:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian huan, Eden ah na teng a; suangmantam chiteng in na kituam a, sardi, topaz suang leh diamond, beril, onik, jasper, sapphir, emerald, karbankul, a phumkipna leh a gelh kilawmna dangkaeng a bawlte, nang siam ni a bawlsate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang chingmi Cherub sathau nilh na hi; Pathian tang siangthou ah k’on omsak a, meisuangte lak ah na vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na hoih buching; siam a na omni a kipan, nang a diktatlouhna a om mateng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sumsinna a pung hulhul; a hon diksak, hiamgamna in, khelhna ah na pukta hi; Pathian tang a kipan in bangmahlou in ka hon paita a; chingmi Cherub in a hon delhkhia a, meisuangte lak a kipan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kilawmna ziak a hong kisathei in, na thupina a na pilna hihsia in, lei ah ka honpai a, etnop din kumpipate ma ah mual ah ka honphou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na sumsin diktatlouhnate ah, na siatna ziak in, na mun siangthoute na hihbuah a, huaiziak in mei ka khah; na sung a kipan, a hong kangbei, lei ah leivui k’on suaksak; a hon musekte tengteng muh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite lak a a honthei peuhmah lamdangsak, launa na hongsuakta; na om ngeinawn kei ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Sidon masuan inla, a tungthu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi: Ka honnang ahi, aw Sidon, ka hihlang ding, ka thupina; nang ah Toupa ka hihdan a thei ding ua, amah ah vai ka hawm hun chiang in, ka siangthouna ka ensak mahmah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kongzing ah sisan leh hipi ka tungsak ding, asung ah mi liam a puk ding ua; mun kilchih a kipan namsau in. Huan, Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in Israel inkawte sun ding loulingnei a omkei ding a, a kim a amau musitmite lak ah hihna ding ling a omta kei ding; kei Toupa Pathian ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi: Israel inkawte a dalhna gam mite lak a kipan ka pikhawm nawn hun in Jakob kiang a ka piak, a gam mahmah uah a tengta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in bittak in a omta ding ua; ahi, innte a lam ding ua; grephuante a bawl ding ua; bittak in a om ding ua; a kim ua musit mite tengteng tung a vai ka hawm chiang in kei Toupa a Pathian uh ka hi chih a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmna, kha sawmna, huai kha ni sawmnihna ah Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Aigupta kumpipa Pharo masuan inla, a tung ah leh Aiguptami tengteng tung ah thu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gen inla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in, Aigupta kumpipa, Pharo luipite lai ah Olepi thupitak, Ka luipi kei a ahi, keimah ngei adia ka bawl, chipa kondou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na haizekte ah ngakuai in k’on man ding a; luipi a ngasate na lip ding in ka belhsak ding a; luipi lai a kipan na lip ah ngasate tengteng toh ka hon botkhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan gamdai ah ka honpai ding a, nang leh na luipi a ngasa tengteng leng; gamlak ah na puk dia; na luang lawn a hi kei ding a, vui na hi sam kei ding; gam sahangte lehtungleng vasate kiang ah an dia honpe ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel Inkawte adia sialluang chiang lel na hong hih ziak in Aigupta gam a teng tengteng in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khut a honlet ua, a liangzang uh na tansak a, na satkhia; honngai ua, a kongte uh kitan a tanglou in na omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai in, na tung ah namsau k’on tun ding a, na lak a kipan mi leh sa ka phuk mang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan Aigupta gam, gam segawp leh khaw sia ahi mai ding a, kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh. Luipi kei a ahi a, ka bawl ahi a, na chih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in kondou ahi, na luipi leng: Seveneh kulh a kipan in Ethiopia gamgi pha in Aigupta gam bel gam segawp leh khosia in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing khe in a sik ngeikei ding a, sate leng a pai ngeikei ding ua; kum sawmli sung in luah in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta gam segawpte lak a khat in ka bawl ding a, a khopite ka khopi siate lak ah kum sawmli a kigawp ding: Aigupta mite namte lak ah ka dalhsak ding a, gamchih ah ka dalhsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi; Kum sawmli nung in a dalhna mite ua kipan Aigupta mite ka lakhawm nawn ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta mite omdan ka hei ding a, a pianna gam uh, Pathros gam ah ka kiksak ding; huchi in huai ah vualleltak in a lal ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalna gam a vuallel pen ahi ding, namte lak ah leng a kilalsak nawn sam kei ding hi; Namdang tung a thu a neih nawn louhna ding un amau ka neusak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau lam nga peuhmah in a thulimlouhna uh a theihkhiak pih ziak in Israelte muanpi ahi nawnta kei ding uh; huan Toupa Pathian ka hi chih a thei ding uh, a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, kum sawmnih leh sagihna, kha khatna, huai kha ni khat ni’n Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in Tura tung ah na thupitak sem ding in a sepaih hon a sawl a, michih lu a giau loh a, michih liangzang in a dulh loh lai a; himahleh amah leh a sepaih honte’n a na sepna uah Tura a kipan punna bangmah a mu tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in chi ahi: ngai in, Aigupta gam Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kiang ah ka pe ding a, a thil hauh ziazuate a lamang ding a, a lok ding a, a gallak sak ding; huai a sepaih honte loh a himai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka na a sep ziak un Aigupta gam a loh ding un ka pia ahi, Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Israel inkawte ding in ki ka pou khesak ding a; a lak uah na kam ka ka sak ding; huchi in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, thu gen inla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kikou un, maizen! maizen, tua ni tel: ni a nai hi, Toupa ni a nai hi, mei kai ni, pautuam mite siatna ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hongtung ding, namsau, Aigupta tung ah; sinlai natna, Ethiopia tung ah, Aigupta ah mi thah a puk un; a thil hauh ziazuate a lamang ding ua, a suangphumte a chimse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia, Pud leh Lud, namchih omkhawm, Kub leh gam tate tel teite tengteng, a puk ding uh, namsau in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Aigupta tungding mite leng a puk ding ua, a hatna suanpen uleng a vuallel ding; Migdol a kipan Suene pha in namsau in a puk ding ua, Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam hihgawpsate lak a khat ahi ding a, a khopite leng khopi gawpsate lak a ahimai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah mei ka khah ding a, amau panpihmite tengteng ka hihsiat hun chiang in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Ethiopia mi kigingloute lunglelsak ding in ka kiang a kipan mi sawl long in a pai ding ua; Aigupta ni mah bang in lungtang mangbatna mahmah a tung uah a tungsam ding hi: ngai in, a hongtung lellel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khut in Aigupta thil hauh ziazuate ka hihmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gam hihse ding in amah leh a lawite, namte lak a kihtakte tunsak ahi ding uh; Aigupta tung ah a namsau uh a lik ding ua, gam mi luang in a dimsak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan luipite ka kangsak ding a, gam migiloute kiang ah ka khong ding; a gam leh asung a om tengteng pautuam mite khut in ka hihgawp ding: kei Toupa’n ka chita ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Milimte ka hihse ding a, Noph khua a kipan milimte ka hihmang ding, Aigupta ah heutu a omta kei ding uh: huchi in Aigupta gam ah launa ka omsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros ka hihgawp ding a, Zoan ah mei ka khah dia; No khua ah ka tangtung sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan Aigupta kulh Sin khaw tung ah ka hehna ka lungdamsak ding a, No khua a mipite ka phukmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan Aigupta ah mei ka khah ding a, Sin khua buaitak in a om ding a, No khua leng a chim vek ding: Noph khua in sun chiang in melma a nei nilouh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aven leh Pibeseth khaw tangvalte namsau in a puk ding ua, huai khuate sal a pi in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta hakkol ka hihtan a, a hatna a kisaktheihpih ka hihbei hun Tehphanhes khua ah ni a mial ding; amah zaw meipi in a liah ding a, a tanute sal a pi in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichibang in Aigupta gam ah thu ka tangtung sak ding: huchi in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, kum sawmlehkhatna, kha khatna, huai kha ni sagih ni’n Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Aigupta kumpipa Pharo ban ka kitansak a, ngai in, namsau tawi ding a hat nawnna din damdawi nuh leh tuam a loh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in Aigupta kumpipa Pharo ka dou ahi, a ban a hoih lam leh a kitansa nunglam leng ka kitansak ding a; huchi in, a khut a kipan namsau ka kitansak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta mite namte lak ah ka dalhsak ding a, gamchih ah ka thelthangsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa bante ka hatsak ding a, a khut ah namsau ka tawisak ding a; Pharo bante ka kitansak ding a, a ma ah sihpih khop liam thum in a thum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Babulon kumpipa bante ka hatsak ding a, Pharo bante bel a luaikhe ding; Babulon kumpipa khut ah ka namsau ka tawisak a, Aigupta kumpipa tung a a lik hun chiang in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta mite namte lak ah ka dalhsak ding a, gamchih ah ka thelthangsak vek ding; huchi in, Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, kum sawm leh khatna, kha thumna, huai kha ni khat ni’n Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Aigupta kumpipa Pharo leh a khua leh a mite kiang ah gen inla: Thupina ah kua na bang a ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, Lebanon hiang kilawm leh bawkpha, lim sah, sang kilawm, a dawn meilak ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui in a hon vak a, tuithuk in a khangsak hulhul, a phuhna luite’n a luan kual ua, gam sing chih vakna d’in a luangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in gam sing teng zou in a sang tuan a; a hiang a khang, a hiang a sau, tuipi vak, a meng khesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hiang ah tungleng vasate’n bu a bawl ua; a hiang nuai ah sa chiteng in nou a nei ua; a lim nuai ah a nam thupi teng a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, a kilawm, a thupina, a hiangte sauna ah zel in; a zung lah tui tampite kiang ah a om ngal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian huan a sidar singte’n a phazou kei ua; a bawk, meilah sing in a dem zou kei a; a hiang sesing in a phazou sam kei; a kilawmna ah Pathian huan a sing a bang zoukei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hiang tamsak in ka bawl hoih a, Pathian huan a Eden sing teng in a haza uhi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: A hongsan mahmah a, meipi lak a a dawn a len a, a lungtang a a sandan a kisaktheihpih ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Namte lak ah mihat tak khut ah ka mansak ding: a thulimlouhdan bang in a gawt ding a, ka delhkhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in pautuam mi namte lak a kihtakhuai mahmahte’n a phuk ding ua, a nuse ding uh: tangte, guamte ah a hiangte a ke lemlum ding a, huai gam tuiluanna guam tengteng ah a hiangte a kitan lemlum ding: khovel a mi tengteng a lim a kipan a pawtkhe ding ua, amah a paisan ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A siatna ah tungleng vasa tengteng a teng ding ua, a bawk tung ah gamsate a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai bel tui a vak sing tengteng a kisan saklouh ua, a dawn uh meipi kal a lengsak lou a, tui a vak sing in a sandan uh a suan sam louhna ding uh ahi: lei mun nuainungpen a kawkhuk a paisukta, mihing tate lak ah pai ding in, sihna a matsak ahivekta ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Sheol a a paisuk ni’n amah ka sunsak a, luitui thuktak te ka khawlsak a; huai ah tui tampi let dingte ka daltan a; Lebanon amah ka sunsak lai a; gam sing tengteng amah ziak in a gim khin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namte leng a puk ging ah ka lingsak a, kawkhuk a paisuksate kiang a Sheol a ka paihkhiak ni’n; Eden sing tengteng, Lebanon sing hoih tata, tui a vak tengteng lei nuainungpen ah lungmuang in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Namsau a thahte kiang ah Sheol ah a paisuk ua; ahi, namte lak a, a limnuai a tengte leh namte lak a a kizoppihte toh hankhuk a tungsuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eden singte lak a thupina leh letna ah kua ahia nang bang om? Himahleh Eden singte toh lei mun nuainungpen ah paihkhiak na hi ding; namsau a thah, zeksumlouhte lak ah na lum ding hi. Hiai bel Pharo leh a khua leh tuite ahi uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hiai ahi, kum sawmlehnihna, kha sawmlehnihna, huai kha ni khat ni a Toupa thu ka kiang a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Aigupta kumpipa Pharo sunna la phuak inla, a kiang ah: Namte humpinelkai lunlai kibatpih: tuipi a Olepi na bang zaw hi; na nak a tuite phuansak in, na khe in na toknin a, a luite uh na ninsak vekta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: ka len in ka honkhuh ding a, mi tampi toh, ka len in nang a honman ngeingei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamlak ah k’on nuse ding a, gamlak ah k’on pai ding; tung a leng tengteng ka samkhawm ding, na tung ah; nang in leipumpi gamsa, ka taisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tang chih ah na sa ka lui ding a; na luang in guamte ka dimsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tenna gam tang tan in, na sisan in ka sil ding a, guam chih leng nangmah in a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />K’on chimih sak hun chiang in, van ka khuh in aksi ka mialsak ding; meipi in ni ka liah mang ding; kha in a vakna a suah kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tung ah van vakna teng ka mialsak ding; na gam ah khomial ka leng sak ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na theihlouh gam a namte lak a na siatna ka tunsak hun chiang in mi tampite lungtang ka lungzingsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi, mi tampi nangmah ah lamdangsa in ka bawl ding a, a ma ua ka namsau ka leh hun chiang in nang ziak in a kumpipate uh leng mulkimhuai a sa un a lau mahmah ding uh; na puk ni’n michih in a hinna uh tan lau in a lingling ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ngal a: Babulon kumpipa namsau na tung ah a hongtung dek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mite ka puksak ding, galhatmite namsau in, namte lak a kihtakhuai pente ahi uh, a hihse ding uh. Aigupta mite thupina, a mipite tengteng a hihmang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui tampi gei gamsa teng ka hihmang ding; mi khete’n a ngap ninta kei ding; gamsa khete’n leng a ngap nin sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in tui ka chimsak ding a, ka luangsak ding, luite, sathau bang in, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta gam ka hihse gawp dia, a hauhna tengteng ah vuaktang in, asung a tengte ka phukmang hun in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ngei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai a kahla ding uh ahi; namchih tanute’n hiai a kah in Aigupta leh a mi tengteng a sun ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, kum sawmlehnihna, huai kha ni sawmlehnga ni’n Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Aigupta mipite kah ekek inla, amah leh nam minthang tak tanute kawkhuk a paisuk khinte toh lei nuainung lam ah paikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kilawmna ah kua a khup a? Paisuk inla zeksumlouhte lak ah lum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau a thahsate lak ah a puk ding ua, namsau kiang a piak ahi khin ua, amah leh a mite tengteng kaimang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sheol a om galhat mi mahmahte’n amah leh a panpihmite a houpih ding ua; a paisuk ua, a lum nilouh ua, namsau a thah, zeksumlouhte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai ah Assuria leh a heute tengteng a om ua; a hante uh amah kim ah a om a: avek un thah, namsau a pukvek ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hante uh kawkhuk thuk pen ah a om a, a han kim ah a heute a om uh; avek ua thah, namsau a puk vek, mihing gam galmuanglou sakmite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai ah Elam leh a han kim ah a heute a om ua; avek ua, namsau a puk, lei nuainung a zeksumlouh a paisuk ua, mihing gam galmuanglou sakmite, a zahlakna uh kawkhuk a paipih sukte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi thahte lak ah amah leh a heute lupna a bawlsak ua, a hante amah kim ah a om a; avek un zeksumlouh, namsau a thah, ahi ua; a kihtakhuaina uh mihing gam gallauna ahi nak a; kawkhuk a paisuktate toh a zahlakna uh a pua ua, mi thahte lak ah a omsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai ah Meshek leh Tubal, a heute utoh a om ua; a hante uh amau kim ah a om a; avek un zeksumlouh, namsau a thah ahi uh; a kihtakhuaina un mihing gam a hihmang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zeksumlouh, mihat pukte, kidouna galvan toh Sheol a paisuktate, a namsau uh lukham a nei, a guhte uh tung a a lum omte kiang ah a lum kei uh: amau lah mihing gam a mi hatte launa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang zaw zeksumlouhte lak ah kitan lemlum in na om ding a, namsau a site kiang ah na lum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huai ah Edom, a kumpipate leh a heutute tengteng a om ua: a hatna ua; namsau a thahte lak ah a sial uh hi; zeksumlouh, kawkhuk a paisuksate kiang a lum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huai ah mallam heutute, avek un, Sidon mi tengteng, thahte lak a paisuksate a om ua, a hatna un mi a gallausak na a, a zum ua, zeksumlouh in namsau a thahte lak ah a lum ua; kawkhuk a paisuk khinte toh a zahlak khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pharo in amaute a mu ding a, a mite tengteng a lungmuan loh ding, Pharo leh a sepaih hon tengteng, namsau a thahte ngei leng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing gam ah gallauna a lengsak a, zeksumlouh, namsau a thahte lak ah a lum ding uhi, Pharo leh a mi tengteng ngei, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, na nam tate kiang ah thu gen inla, a kiang uah, Gam tung a namsau ka hontut leh gam mite’n a lak ua pat mi khat a telkhiak ua, galvilmi dia a koih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman gam tung a namsau hongtung a muh leh pengkul a mut ding a, mipite a kigalging sak ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in kuapeuh pengkul ging za a poisalou mi, namsau hongtung in manloh tamahleh, a sisan mawh amahmah in a paw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pengkul ging a zak a a poisaklouh ziak in a sisan mawh a puak mai ding ahi: a na poisak lebel a hin a humbit ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh galvilmi in namsau hongtung a muh a, a pengkul a mutlouh a, mipite a kigalgin louh ua, namsau a hongtun a, a lak ua mi kuahiam in a manloh leh a thulimlouhna in a mangthang ding a, a sisan phu galvilmi a kipan ka la ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchibang in nang, mihing tapa, Israel inkawte adia galvil dia k’on bawl na hi; huaiziak in ka kam a thupawt ngaikhia inla, ka kiang a kipan kigalginna ding thu a kiang uah hilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Migilou kiang ah, “Aw migilou, si mahmah ding na hi” ka chih a, migilou a omdan paisan ding a na hilh kei leh migilou a gitlouhna ah a si ding a, a sisan phu bel nang a kipan ka la ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh migilou a omdan paisan ding a na hilh a, a omdan a paisan kei lai leh, a gitlouhna ah a si ding a, nang bel na hin na humbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan mihing tapa, nang Israel inkawte kiang ah thu gen inla, Hichibang in na chi ua, “Ka tatleknate uh leh ka khelhnate un a hon delhkhum a, huaiziak in ka thanggawp uh ahi, bangchi’n ka hing nilouh thei ding ua?” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng, migilou sihna ah kipahna ka neikei a, migilou in a omdan a paisan a a hin ka kipahlam ahizaw. Na omdan hoihlou ua kipan kik un, kik un, Aw Israel inkawte, bangdia si ding na hi ua? chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang, mihing tapa, na nam tate kiang ah gen inla, Mi diktat diktanna in a tatlekna ni’n amah a humbit kei ding a, migilou gitlouhna in leng a thulimlouhna a lehngatsan ni’n a puksak kei ding a, mi diktat lah a khelhna ni’n a diktatna in a hing thei tuan sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi diktat kiang ah, na hing ngeingei ding, chih ka gen in, a diktatna muang a thil a hihkhelh leh a thil dik hih khat leng theih gige ahi kei ding; a thil hihkhelhsa ah a sizaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan migilou kiang ah, “Na si ngeingei ding” ka chih nawn leuleu in, a gitlouhnate a lehngatsan a a siang leh a dik a na hih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilou in mi koih khamnate pekik a, a thilgukte a piaknawn a, hinna dante a zuih a, thulimlouhna bangmah ahihkei leh a hing ngeingei ding a, a si kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khelhna a na hihsa bangmah theihgige ahita kei ding a, a siang leh a dik a na hihta a, a hing ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh na nam tate’n, “ Toupa thilhihdan a kikim kei” a chih un amau hihdan a diktat kei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi diktat in a diktatna a lehngatsan a, thil gilou a na hihleh huaiziak in a si maiding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan migilou in a gitlouhna a lehngatsan a, a siang leh a dik ahihleh huaiziak in a hing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh “ Toupa hihdan a kikim kei” na chi ua, aw Israel Inkawte michih noumau hihdan bang in k’on lelsak ding hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, i saltan kum sawmlehnih, kha sawmna, huai kha ni nga ni’n Jerusalem a kipan taikhia mi khat ka kiang ah a hongpai a, “Khopi zoh ahita” a hong chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai mi taikhia a hongtun ma nitaklam in Toupa’n ka tung ah a khut a nga a; zinglam a ka kiang a hongpai in ka kam a hon ka sak a, huchi in ka kam ka ka a, pautheilou in ka omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel gam a mun segawpsa nung a omte’n, “Abraham khat ahi a, gam a luah a; eite bel tampi i hi ua, gam gouluah ding a piak hita ve hang” chi in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in a kiang uah Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Sa sisan na ne ua, na milimte uh lam ah na mitte uh na lengtou sak ua; sisan na suah ua, noute’n gam na tang ding umaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na namsau uh na muang ua; thilkihhuai na hih ua; michih in invengpa zi na hihbuah ua; noute’n gam na tang ding uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hichibang a a kiang ua na gen ding ahi, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi; A hin a ka hin laiteng, mun segawpsa nung a omte namsau in a puk ngeingei ding ua, gamlak a omte sahang kiang ah nekkhit dia pe ding ka hi; kulh kip leh khuk a omte hipi in a si ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gam leng ka hihsia in, mulkimhuaitak in ka bawl ding a; a thilhihtheihna, a kisaktheihpih a beita ding; Israel tangte a segawp ding a, kuamah a vialvak nawnta kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thil kihhuai a hih ziak ua gam ka hihgawp a, mulkimhuai tak a ka bawl hun chiang in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan nang, mihing tapa, bangbul ah kongpite ah na nam tate’n a hon ngen susup ding ua, michih in a unaute kiang ah, “Kisa dih ua: Toupa kiang a kipan thupawt i ngaikhe ding uh” a kichi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in a hon hon in na kiang ah a hongpai ding ua, ka mite bang mai in na ma ah a tu ding ua, na thu a ngaikhe ding ua, himahleh a zui tuankei ding uh; a kam un itna thupitak a hihlang ding ua, a lungtang un bel punna lam a zuan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngai in, nang bel amau ading in itna la, kilawm tak a sakleh tum bang na hi ding: na thute a ngaikhia ua, himahleh a zui tuankei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hiai a hongtun hun chiang in Ngai in, a hongtung lellel hi, a lak uah zawlnei a om chih a thei ding uhi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israelte belamchingte tung ah thu gen in, thu gen inla, a kiang uah, belamchingte kiang mahmah ah, huchi in Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi: Israelte belamching, amau kivak maimahte tung a gik hi: belamchingte’n belamte vak lou ding ahi uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaute na ne ua, a mul in na kizem ua; a thauthau na gou ua, belamte na vak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Natna veite, mangte n’on pi kei uh; a mangte na zong kei ua; khauhtak leh na mahmah in na thunun zaw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Belampute a omlouh ziak un dalhsak in a na omta ua; a na dalh ua, gam sahangte an lel a hong hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka belamte tang chih leh mual chih ah a vakmang ua; ahi, ka belamte leitung tengteng ah a na dalhkhin uh; limsakmi leh zawngmi a omkei uh, chi in gen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in belamchingte aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, belamching a omlouh ua, belamchingte’n ka belamte a zon louh ua, belamchingte’n ka belamte a vak louh ua, amau a kivak zawksop ziak un ka belamte gam sahangte an lel a honghi ua; ka belamte samat lel a honghi petmah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in nou belamchingte aw, Toupa thu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi: Ngai un, belamchingte ka dou ahi; a khut ua kipan ka belamte ka sut ding a, ka belamte a kepna uh ka tawpsak ding a, belamchingte leng amau a kivak takei ding uh; a angsung ua kipan ka belamte ka lakhe ding a, amau dia nekding a hih nawnlouhna ding un, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi ngal a: Ngai un, kei, keimahmah in ka zong ding a, ka zongkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Belamching in a belam dalhte lak a a belamhonte a zonlai bang in ka belamte ka zongkhe ding; khonim ni leh mial nuai a a dalhna tengteng ua kipan ka zongkhe ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan mite lak a kipan ka lakhe ding a; gamchih a kipan ka kaikhawm ding a; amau gam ngei ah ka pilut ding; Israel tangte ah, lui geite ah, mi tenna mun tengtengte ah ka tasak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Loupa hoihtak munte ah ka tasak ding a; a huangsung uh Israel tang sangte ah a om ding; huang hoihtak sung ah leng a om ding ua, Israel tang tung a loupa dawng munte ah a ta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei mahmah in ka belamte ka vak ding a; ka kualsak kinken ding a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mang ka zong ding a, delhmangte ka pikik nawn ding a, a khe kitante uh ka tuam ding a, ka hatsak ding: a thau leh a hatte leng ka ching ding a; diktak in ka vak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan nou tungthu ahihleh, aw ka belamhonte, hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi: Ngai un, ka belamte kalthu ka gensak ding a, belamtalte, keltalte leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gan tatna mun hoihtak tung a tat nou din thil bang thamlou bang a lang in, na tatna neihsun na chilse zawsop uh ahi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan tuichim mahmahte na dawn khit un na ngap nin mawkmawk uh ahi maw? Ka belamte’n na siksa uh a ne un, na ngahsa uh a dawn ding umaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in hichi in Toupa Pathian in a kiang uah a chi: Ngai un, kei, keimahmah in gan gawngte leh gan thaute kalthu ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hatloute na liang un leh na sikte un na phu ua, na khete un na pik ua, na dalhsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka belamte ka humbit ding; samat lel ahi nawn kei ding ua, belamte kalthu ka gensak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan a tung uah belamching khat ka koih ding a, ka nasempa David ngei: aman amaute a vak ding a; amah amau chingpa ahi ding a, amau a vak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in kei a Toupa Pathian uh ka hi ding a, ka nasempa David a tung ua heutu ahi ding; kei Toupa ngei in ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau toh lemna thukhun ka bawl ding a, sahangte gam a kipan ka hihmang ding: gamdai ah leng bittak in a teng ding ua, gammang nuaite a ihmu hihit ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amau leh ka tang kim munte ka vualzawl ding a; a hun geihgeih in vuah ka zusak ding a, vualzawl vuahte a zu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan gam a sing in gah a suah ding a, lei in a punna a suah ding a; a gam uah bittak in a om ding uh; a hakkolte uh ka kitansak a, sikha a bawlmite khut a kipan ka hutkhiak hun chiang in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Namdangte samat lel ahi nawnta kei ding ua, gam sahangte nekmang mai ahi nawn kei ding uh; bittak in a omzaw ta ding ua, kuamah in a lausak ngei nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thilsuan minthang mahmah ka bawlsak ding a; huai gam ah kial in a hihmang nawn kei ding a, namdangte muhsitna leng a thuak nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan kei Toupa a Pathian uh a kiang uah ka om chih a thei un, amau Israel inkawte leng ka mite ahi uh chih a thei ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huan nou ka belamte, ka gantatna mun a belamte na hi ua; kei na Pathian uh ka hi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Seir tang masuan inla, a tung ah thu gen in. A kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in, Aw Seir tang, k’on dou hi, na tung ah ka khut ka lik ding a, k’on hihgawp in mulkimhuaitak in k’on bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na khopite ka suse ding a, na kigawp ding; huan Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nitna uh gawtna nanungpen a a siat ni ua Israel inkawte namsau thilhihtheihna a na lata, na kinakpih gige ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng, sisan ading in k’on bawl ding a, sisan in a hondelh ding: sisan na huat louh zak in sisan in a hondelh ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichi in Seir tang bel mulkimhuaitak a bawl in ka sugawp ding; a tung a mi vialvakte ka tawpsak vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tangte amah mi thahte in ka dimsak ding: na tangte ah, na guam leh na luiguam kuakte ah namsau a thahte a puk phengphung ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />K’on sugawp den ding a, na khopite luah in a omkei ding: huan kei Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa zaw a om gige na a, “Hiai nam nihte leh gam nihte kei a ahi ding a, ka tang maiding uh” na chih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hin a ka hin laiteng chih, Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, na hehna bangzel leh na huatna ziak a hazatna na suklatdan bangzel in ka hih ding ahi: na tungthu ka ngaihtuah hun chiang in a lak uah ka hihlang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hihgawp in a omta ua, ka kiang ah piak in a omta uh” chi a Israel tangte na gensiatna tengteng kei Toupa’n ka zavek chih na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tung ah na kam in na kiliansak in ka tung ah thu na tamsak a, ka za vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi: Lei pumpi kipahna ding in k’on sugawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israelte gouluah a siat ziak a na kipah mah bang in na tung ah ka hih ding: Aw Seir tang leh Edom tengteng, avek in a kisegawp ding: huchi in Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan nang mihing tapa, Israel tangte kiang ah thu gen inla, Nou Israel tangte aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia un. Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tung ah na melmate’n, “Aha! ‘nidang munsang tengtengte kei a ahita’ a chih ziak un” thu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Nam omsunte ading a kil chih a nang a honnek ua, a hon sukgawp ziak un leh mi kamtamte houlimna leh gensiat a a hon omsak ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nou Israel tangte aw, Toupa Pathian thu ngaikhia un, Toupa Pathian in tangte, mualte, luiguamte, guamte, leh mun sesate, khopi kigawpsa, a kim a nam omsunte samat lel ding leh nuihsan dingte kiang ah hichi in a chi ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Nam omsun leh Edom tengteng lungsim kipaktak a ka gam nana kiseh tawm ua; n’on musit mahmah ua, gallak a bawl mite tung ah ka mullitna thangpaih mahmahna in thu ka gen ngei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Israel gam tungthu ah thu gen inla, tangte, mualte, luiguamte leh guamte kiang ah Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: ngai un, namdangte simmohna na thuak ziak un mullit mahmah leh thangpai tak in thu ka gen ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Na kim a namte’n amau zahlakna a paw ngei ding uh chi in ka khut ka zak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nou bel, Aw Israel tangte aw, hiang na suah ding ua, ka mi Israelte adin gah na suah ding uh; a hongpai dek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai un, nou lam a pang ka hi ngal a, nou lam ka nga ding a, kalhnen in na om ding ua, chi tuh in na omlai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na tung uah mihing ka pungsak ding a, Israel inkawte tengteng, avek un: mun sesate bawlphat in a om ding a, khopite luah in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tung uah mi leh sa ka pungsak ding a, a pung un a lamzang ding uh: Na omdan masa bang in luahin k’on omsak ding a, a tung a na omdan sang ua hoih in k’on bawl ding hi: huchi in kei Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, na tung uah mi ka vaksak ding a, ka mi Israelte ngei; a honluah ding ua, a goutan uh na hi ding a, tubansiah a tate uh na tansak ngei nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa Pathian in a chi ahi: “Nang mihingte ne mang, na mite tansek na hi” a hon chih ziak un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihingte na ne bei nawnta kei ding a, na mite leng na tan ngei n’on sam kei ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pautuam mite muhsitna k’on thuaksak nawn kei ding a, mite gensiat na thuak ngei nawn kei ding; na mite na tan ngei nawn kei ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Israel inkawte amau gam a a tenlai un a omdan uleh a thilhihte un a kihihnin ua; ka ma a a omdan uh numei kizenlouh lai a a sianthou louhna bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in gam tung ah sisan a suah ua, a milimte ua a kihihnit ziak un a tung uah ka hehna ka lungdam sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Namte lak ah ka dalhsak a, gamchih ah a thehthangta ua: a omdan uleh a thilhihte uh bangzel in a tungthu uh ka gensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A vahohna namte kiang a tun un ka min siangthou a hihbuah ua; mite’n, “Hiaite Toupa mite ahi ua, gam a kipan hong pawtkhia ahi uh” a na chih nakna uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh Israel inkawte’n a vahohna namte lak a a hihbuah uh, ka min siangthou ka lainat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in Israel inkawte kiang ah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Aw, Israel inkawte, noute k’on lainat ziak hilou in, na vahohna namte lak a na hihbuah uh, ka min siangthou ka lainat ziak zaw in hiai ka hih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka min thupitak, namte lak a buah, a lak ua noumau ngei a hihbuah ka siangthousak ding ahi; huchi in a mitmuh ua noute a hih siangthou a ka om hun chiang in Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Namte lak a kipan ka hon pikhe ding a, gam tengtengakipan k’on kai khawm ding a, na gam mahmah uah k’on pilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan na tung uah tuichim ka theh ding a, na hong siangthou ding ua, na nitna tengteng uleh na milimte lak ua kipan ka honkhuah siang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungtang thak ka honpe dia, na sung uah kha thak ka koih ding: na sa ua kipan lungtang suang bang a sak ka lamang ding a, lungtang sa bang a nip k’on pe zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na sung uah ka kha ka koih ding a, ka dan bawl ah k’on vaksak ding a, ka thupiakte na kem ding ua, na zui ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na pipute uh kiang a ka piak gam ah na teng ding uh; nou ka mite na hi ding ua, kei na Pathian uh ka hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na nitna tengteng ua kipan k’on hunkhe ding a, buh leh bal ka sam ding a k’on pungsak ding, na tung uah kial a ke nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Singgahte ka pungsak ding a, louma ka pungsak ding a, kial ziak a namte lak a zahlakna na thuak kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in na omdan giloute uh, na thilhih hoihloute uh na theigige ding ua, na kihhuaina uleh na thulimlouhna uh ziak in noumau mitmuh mahmah in na kihta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nou ziak a hiai hih ka hi kei chih na thei mai un, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi. Aw, Israel inkawte aw, na omdan ziak un zum unla, lamdangsa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na thulimlouhna tengteng ua kipan k’on khuahsiang ni chiang in, khopite ka luahnawn sak ding a, mun sesa ka bawlnawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huchi in gam sesa, tuma lam a mi vialvakte mitmuh a sesa nung himahleh leh in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hiai gam sesa nung Eden huan bang mai a honghi nawnta, a chi ding uh; khopi sia a, na kigawpsate luah leh um in a om nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huan na kim ua nam omlaite’n kei Toupa’n mun siate ka bawl nawn a, gam na sekhinsa ka hihhoih nawnta chih a thei ding uh: kei Toupa ka pauta a, ka hih ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huan Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Huailou in hiai Israel inkawte k’on dingsak ding a; ganhon bang mai a a mite uh hihpung ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kithoihna ding ganhon, a Ankuanglui sehsa a Jerusalem ganhonte bang mai in; huchibang in khopi sesa nung mipi tampi in a hong dim ding ua; huchi in kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa khut ka tung ah a om a, Toupa kha in a hon pikhia a, phaizang laitak ah honkoih a; huai phaizang guh ngen in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan a lak uah a honpi vialvial a; phaizang ah guh tampi a na om lemlom a; ngai dih, a keu ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, hiai guhte a hing thei diam?” a chi hi. Ken, “Aw, Toupa Pathian, nang na theizaw hi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, “Thu gen inla, a kiang uah, ‘Aw, nou guh keute aw, Toupa thu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai guhte kiang ah Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai un, noute ah nakna ka lutsak ding a, na hing ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noute ah thagui ka koih ding a, sa in kontuam ding a, vun in k’on khuh ding; huan na sung uah nakna ka omsak ding a, na hing ding uh’; kei Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a hon thupiak bang in ka genta a; ka gen leh husa a hongom a, ngai in, a ging luilui a, guhte amau kizoppih chiat ah a kisutuah khawmta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka et leh, ngai in, amau ah thagui a hongom a, sa in a tuam a, vun in a khuhta a; nakna bel amau ah a om nai kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in aman ka kiang ah, “Huih kiang ah thu gen inla, mihing tapa, gen mahmah in, huih kiang ah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Aw, Nakna, kawlmong li a kipan in hongpai inla, hiai mi thahte tung ah nak in, a hintheihna ding un, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in a hon thupiak bang in ka gen a, nakna amau ah a honglut a, a hingta ua, amau khe chiat in ading ua, sepaih hon thupitak a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, hiai guhte Israel inkaw pumpi ahi ua: Ngai dih, amau, Ka guhte uh a keu khin in, ka lamet uh a bei khinta, phukmang in ka omta uh, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in thu gen inla, a kiang uah Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Ngai un, a hante uh ka hong ding a, aw, Ka mite aw, na han ua kipan k’on khah ding a; huchi in, Israel gam ah k’on pilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na hante uh ka hon a, na han ua kipan k’on pawtsak hun chiang in, aw, ka mite aw, Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan noumau ah ka Kha ka koih ding a, na hing ding uh, na gam ngei uah k’on koih ding a; kei Toupa’n ka chita a, ka hihlai ding ahi chih na thei ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang, mihing tapa, chiang khat la inla, a tung ah, “Judah leh a kithuahpih Israel tate” chih gelh in: chiang dang leng la inla, a tung ah, “Joseph leh Ephraim chiang leh a kithuahpih Israel inkawte tengteng” chih gelh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan chiangte peh inla, na khut a khat a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hiaite bang chihna ahi ua, n’on kawkmuh kei dia hia?” Na nam tate un na kiang a honchih uleh a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai un, Joseph chiang, Ephraim leh a kithuahpih Israel chite khut a ka la ding a, huaite Judah chiang toh ka peh ding a, khat in ka bawl ding a, ka khut ah khat a honghi ding, na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chiang, a tung a na gelhnate mahmah a mitmuh ngei uah na khut ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan a kiang uah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Ngai un, nam, a vahohnate uh lak a kipan ka pi ding a, ning chih a kipan ka kaikhawm ding a, a gam uah ka pilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan huai gam, Israel tangte ah nam khat in ka bawl ding a, kumpipa khat avek ua kumpipa ahi ding: huan, nam nih ahi nawnta kei ding ua, vaihawmna gam nih in leng a kikhen n’on sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A milimte uh, a thil kihhuaite uh, a tatleknate un leng a kihihnin ngei nawnta kei ding ua: a puk ua a khelhna nak tengteng ua kipan ka honkhe ding a, ka khuahsiang ding: huchi in ka mite ahi ding ua, kei a Pathian uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka nasempa David a tung ua kumpipa ahi ding a, avek ua tung ah belamching khat a om ding: ka thupiakte a mang ding ua, ka dan bawlte a zui ding ua, a zang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka nasempa Jakob kiang a ka gam piak, na pipute uh na tenna sek ah a teng ding ua; huai ah tangtawn in a teng ding ua, amau leh a tate uh, a tate uh tate leng: ka nasempa David tangtawn in a heutu uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huailou leng amau kiang ah lemna thukhun ka bawl ding a, amau ading in tangtawn thukhun ahi ding a, a kiang uah kape ding a, amau ka pungsak ding a, a lak uah tangtawn in ka biakbuk ka dingsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka biakbuk leng a kiang uah a om ding a, a Pathian uh ka hi ding a, amau ka mite ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan a lak ua tangtawn a ding a ka biakbuk adin hun chiang in kei Toupa , Israel hih siangthoupa ka hi chih namte’n a thei ding uh, a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tapa, Magog gam a mi, Rosh leh Meshek leh Tubal heutupen Gog masuan inla, a tung ah thu gen inla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in, aw Gog, Rosh, Meshek leh Tubal heutu pen, k’on dou ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />K’on lehngat sak ding a, na haizek ah ngakuai in k’on kuai ding a, k’on khaikhe ding; na sepaih hon tengteng, sakol leh a tungtuang mite, galvan buching a kithuam tengteng, pawl thupitak, lum lian leh lum neu zang a namsau tawichiatte toh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia, Kush, Putte toh, avek ua lum leh sik lukhu neite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer leh a sepaih hon tengteng; Togarmah inkawte, maltawp a mi leh a sepaih hon tengteng, na kiang a mi tampipte toh leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kigalging inla, ahi, na man in, nang leh na kiang a omkhawm, na kithuahpih tengteng toh; huan amau vengpa na hi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni tampi nung in sap khawm na hi ding a, kum nanungte ah namsau a kipan hotkhiak, nam tampite lak a kipan lakkhawmte omna gam, Israel tang se gigete na honsual ding; namte lak a kipan pikhiak a, tua avek ua lungmuangtak a a omna gam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kuantou ding a, huihpi bang mai in na hongtung ding a, meipi in gam a tuam moimoi bang mai na hi ding, nang leh na kiang a sepaih hon tengteng leh na kiang a mi tampite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan hichi in Toupa in a chi ahi: Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, na lungsim ah thil a honglut ding a, thil hoihlou na suangtuah ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in, kulh neilou khuate gam ka sim ding a, mi bittak a om hiathiat, avek ua kulh lou a teng, kulh kongkhak leh a kalhna sik neiloute ka sual ding, na chi sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gallak sum leh vante la ding leh mun sesa nung luahnawn mite leh namte lak a kipan pikhawmsa, ganhon leh vante hau a, lei laizang a tengte tung ah na khut lik na tum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sheba leh Dedan leh Tarshish sumsinmite leh a humpinelkai lunlai tengtengte’n na kiang ah, gallak la ding in na hongpai maw? Honlok ding a na pawlte honkhawm na hi maw? Dangkasik, dangkaeng, ganhon leh van, thupitak suhsak a lamang ding na hi maw? a honchi ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, mihing tapa, thu gen inla, Gog kiang ah, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Huai ni, ka mi Israelte bittak a a om hun ding uh na theikei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mallam gam tawp pek, na mun a kipan in na hongpai ding a, nang leh na kiang a mi tampi sakol tung tuang chiat, pawl thupi mahmah, sepaih hon thupitak mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Meipi in gam a tuam lunglung bang in ka mi Israelte tung ah na hongpai ding; hichi ahi ding a, ni nanungte ah ka gam dou ding in konpi ding a, namte’n a hon thei ding ua, Aw, Gog, a mitmuh ua nang a hih siangthou a ka om hun chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: tuma lam a ka nasempa Israel zawlnei, huailai kum tampi sung a thu na gente’n amaute sual ding a k’on pi ding thu a gensek uh pa na hi hia? chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Israel gam sual ding a Gog a hong kuan hun in ka hehna ka nak khukhe lunglung ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka mullit a ka thangpaih laitak in, huai ni’n Israel gam ah zin nakpi’n a ling ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in tuipi ngate, tungleng vasate, gamsate, leitung a vak ganhing tengteng, leitung a mihing tengteng ka ma ah a ling ding ua, tangte niamsak in a om ding a, kawlte a chim ding a, kulh bang chih lei ah a puk ding, chi in ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tang tengteng ah amah sualna ding in namsau ka sam ding a; michih in namsau in a unaupa a dou ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan sisan pawt leh hipi in amah ka sual ding a; amah leh a sepaih honte leh a kiang a mi tampite tung ah vuahpi leh gial thupi leh mei katte ka zusak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan ka thupidan leh ka siangthoudan ka hihlang ding a, nam tampite mitmuh in ka kihih lang ding, huchi in, kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, nang, mihing tapa, Gog tung ah thu gen inla, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in, Aw Gog, Rosh, Meshek leh Tubal heutu pen, ka hondou ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />K’on lehngatsak ding a, k’on pi zel ding a, mal tawp pek a kipan k’on pikhe ding a, Israel tangte ah k’on tun ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khut veilam a kipan na thalpeu ka kitansak ding a, na khut taklam a kipan na thalte ka kesak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel tangte ah na puk ding a, nang leh na sepaih hon tengteng leh na kiang a mipi omte toh: vasa sasialne chitengte kiang leh gam sahangte kiang ah nekkhit ding in k’on pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamlak ah na puk ding a; ken ka chita a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Magog leh tuigei gam a bittak a tengte tung ah mei ka khah ding; huchi in, kei Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan ka mi Israelte lak ah ka min siangthou ka hih lang ding a, ka min siangthou hihbuah ka phal nawnta kei ding a: huchi in namte’n kei, Toupa Israel Mi siangthoupa ka hi chih a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un, a hongtung hi: hih tangtun in a om ngei ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi; hiai ni ahi ka na gen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan Israel khopi a tengte a pawtkhe ding ua, galvante a khul ding ua, a kangmang ding; lum lian leh lum neute, thal leh a peute, teipi leh chiang zumte kum sagih sung a khul ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in gam sing a pokei ding ua, gammang singte a phuk kei ding uh, galvante sing khul ding in a zang ding ahi ngal ua; gallaklamite gallak in a latei ding ua, a lokmite a lokthuk ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Gog ding in Israel gam ah vuina mun ka sep ding a, tuipi suahlam, Abarim guam ngei; huai in khualzinte a dal ding, Gog leh a lawite a vui ding ua; huchi in, huai guam Hamongog guam a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Israel inkawte’n a gam uh khuahsiang in kha sagih sung a vui ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, a gam ua mi tengteng in a vui ding ua; pahtawi a ka om ni’n ka minthanna ahi ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A gam uh khuahsiang na din, luang vuilouhte teng zongkhia a vui ding in nasep a neiding mi a septuam ding uh, kha sagih beinung in a zong pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gam velmite’n a vel un, mihing guhte a muh uleh chiamtehna a bawl ding ua, Hamongog guam a vuimite’n a vui ma uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan Hamonah khopi min ahi ding. Huchibang in gam a khuahsiang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang, mihing tapa, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Vasa chichihte leh sa chichihte kiang ah thu gen inla, Pung khawm unla, hongpai un, sa na nek ua sisan na dawn theihna ding un Israel tang a kithoihna thupitak, nou adia ka bawl kim ah hong kikhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi thupi sate na ne ding ua, lei a heutute sisan na dawn ding ua; belamtalte, belamnoute, kelte, Bashan gam a bawngtal vak thau tengteng sisan toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nou dia kithoihna Ankuang ka lui thau, vah kikeih in na ne ding ua; a sisan kham khop in na dawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in sakolte, kangtalai kai mite, mi thupite leh galdoumi tengteng in ka Ankuang ah na tai ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in namte lak ah ka thupina ka koih ding a, nam tengteng in a thu gel hihpuksate leh a tung ua ka khut khakdante a mu ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai ni a kipan Israel Inkawte’n kei Toupa a Pathian uh ka hi chih a theita ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Namte’n Israel inkawte a thulimlouhna ziak un salin a tang uh ahi chih a thei ding ua; ka tung a ginom louh mahmah ziak un amau tung ah ka mel ka sel a, huchi in a melmate uh khut ah ka pia a, namsau in a puk vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A sianthou louhna bang zel uleh a tatlekna bang zel un a tung uah ka hihtei a; amau a kipan ka mel ka sel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Tun zaw Jakobte omdan ka hei ding a, Israel inkuan pumpi tung ah zah ka ngai ding, ka min siangthou gum in ka thikthu a se ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kuamah lausakmi omlou a, a gam ua bittak a a ten hun un leng a tatlekna tengteng uh, ka tung a a tatlekna uh leh a zahlakna uh a paw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mite lak a kipan ka pikhiak nawn a, a melmate uh gam a kipan ka kaihkhawm a, amau nam tampi mitmuh a hih siangthou a ka om hun chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan namte lak a sal a ka tansak nawn a, a gam ngei ua ka pikhawm nawn dan ah kei Toupa a Pathian uh ka hi chih a thei ding uh; huai ah a lak ua khat lel leng ka nuse kei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amau a kipan ka mel ka sel nawnta kei ding: Israel inkawte tung ah ka kha ka sungta ngal a, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I saltan kum sawmnih leh ngana, huai kum bul kha ni sawmna, khopi siatnung kum sawmlehlina, huai ni mahmah in Toupa khut ka tung ah a hongom a, huai ah a honpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian kilakna ah Israel gam ah a honpi a, tang sangtak ah a honkoih a, huai simlam ah khopi dinsaksa bangtak a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai ah a honpi a, ngai dih, mi khat a na om a, a mel latdan dal bang mai ahi a; khauzang leh tehna chiang a tawi a, kongpi ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, huai mi in ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, na mit in en inla, na bil in doh in; k’on etsak ding lam ah na lungsim nga chinten in; huai k’on etsak ding ziak a hiai a konpi na hi ngal a: na muh tengteng Israel inkawte kiang ah phuang in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan ngai dih, inn kim ah kulhbang a na om a, huai mi’n tehna chiang, tong guk a sau a tawi a, a tong khat bel tong khat leh khutpek bok chia ahi a; kulh bang sah lam a teh a, chiang khep khat ahi a, a san lam leng chiang khep khat mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in suahlam chial kongpi a hongtung a, a kalbi ah a paitou a; kongpi lutna dantan a teh a, chiang khep khat a za ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan vilna dantante a dunglam chiang khep khat, a vailam chiang khep khat chiat ahi; vilna dantan kikal tong nga chiat ahi a; huan Inpi lam kongpi sumtong kongpi lutna dantan chiang khep khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inpi lam sumtong leng a teh a, tong giat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bangkate tong nih chiat ahi a, kongpi sumtong Inpi lam ah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan suahlam kongpi vilna dantante a langtuak ah thum tuaktuak ahi a, a thum un a kikim vek uh ahi: huan, bangkate leng a langtuak ah a kikim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kongpi lutna vailam a teh a, tong sawm ahi a; kongpi pai suakna vailam tong sawmthum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan vilna dantan ma ah deidanna langkhat ah tong khat a sah tuaktuak a om a; huchi in vilna dantante langtuak tong guk tuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, kongpi a teh a, vilna dantan khat tung a kipan a a langkhat tungpha in tong sawmnih leh nga a za ahi, kongkhak leh kongkhak kizom chiat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sumtong leng a teh a, tong sawmnih ahi a; kongpi sumtong pua bel huangsung ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan kongpi pawnungpen a kipan a kongpi sumtong sunggil pen chiang tong sawmnga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan kongpi sunglam ah a kimvel in dantante ah tohlet hon theihlouh a om a, a kikal a khuamte ah leng; a sumtongte ah leng, a sunglam ah leng a kimvel in tohlet a om a, a khuamte ah tum singlim a om chiat nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan huangsung pawnung zaw ah a honpi a; ngai dih, dantante a om a, huangsung a kimvel in suanglep ahi a; huan, suanglep ah dantan sawmthum a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan suanglep bel kongpi a kipan a lep ahi a, kongpi tan ding mah a lep ahi a, huai bel suanglep nuainung zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in kongpi nuai zaw pen zawn a kipan in huang sungnung zaw pen pawlam pha in a teh a, a zatdan suahlam leh a mallam leng tong za khat ahi..
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan, huangsung pawnung zaw pen kongpi mallam pang a a dung leh a vai leng a teh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan vilna dantante a langtuak ah thum tuaktuak a om a, a bangkate leh a kongpi sumtongte leng amasa bang vek ahi; a dung tong sawmnga ahi a, a vai tong sawmnih leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tohlette a sumtongte a tumsing limte suahlam kongpi a bang vek ahi; kalbi sagih a omtou a; a sumtong a sunglam ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huang sungnung zaw pen lutna ding kongpi bel kongpi dang zawn ah a om zel a, mallam leh suahlam ah leng; kongpi leh kongpi kikal a teh a, tong za ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan, simlam ah a hon pinawn a, ngai in, simlam kongpi a na om a; a tehdan ngei in a bangkate leh a sumtong a teh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai ah a dangte bangmah in a kimvel in tohlette a om a, a sumtong ah leng; a dung tong sawmnga ahi a, a vailam tong sawmnih leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan kalbi sagih a omtou a, sumtong a sunglam ah a om a; a langtuak a bangkate ah tumsing lim a om zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Simlam ah huang sungnung lutna ding kongpi a om a, simlam kongpite kikal a teh a, tong za khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan simlam kongpi ah huang sungnung zaw pen ah a honpi a, tehna ngei in simlam kongpi a teh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vilna dantante, a bangkate sumtongte tehna mah in; huai ah tohlette a om a, a sumtong leng a kimvel in: a dunglam tong sawmnga, a vailam tong sawmnih leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan a kimvel ah sumtongte a om a, a dunglam tong sawmnih leh nga, a vailam tong nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sumtongte huangsung pawnung zaw lam a nga a; a bangkate ah tumsing lim a om a: a kahtouhna in kalbi giat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan suahlam ah huang sungnung zaw pen ah a honpi a, a tehna ngei in kongpi a teh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A vilna dantante, a bangkate, a sumtongte tehna mah in: huai ah tohlette a om a, sumtong leng a kimvel in: a dunglam bel tong sawmnga, a vai lam tong sawmnih leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A sumtongte’n huangsung pawnung zaw pen lam a nga a, a bangkate ah langtuak ah tumsing lim a om a; a kahtouhna in kalbi giat a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huan mallam kongpi ah a honpi nawn a: a tehna ngei in a teh a; a vilna dantante, a bangkate, a sumtongte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huai ah a kimvel in tohlette a om a: a dunglam tong sawmnga ahia, a vailam tong sawmnih leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A bangkate huangsung pawnung zaw pen lam ah a om a; a bangkate ah a langtuak ah tumsing lim a om hi: a kahtouhna in kalbi giat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kongpi sumtong a kipan a lut theih in dantan a om a, huai ah haltum kithoihna ding a silzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kongpi sumtong langtuak ah dohkan nih tuak a om a; haltum kithoihnate, khelh ziak a kithoihnate, mawh ziak a thillatte gohna ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mallam kongpi lutna kahtouhna pawlam sik khat ah dohkan nih a om a; kongpi sumtong langkhat ah leng dohkan nih a om nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huchi in kongpi sik langkhat ah dohkan li a om a, a langkhat ah dohkan li a om nawn; kithoihna gan gohna dohkan giat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huan haltum kithoihna dia dohkan li, suangsek a bawl, a dunglam tong khat leh a kimkhat, a vailam tong khat leh a kim khat, a sanlam tong khat a om a: huai ah haltum kithoihna leh thillat gohna ding vanzatte a koih zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huan a sunglam ah a kimvel in kuaika, khutpek khuh a sau a bulh ua; dohkan tungte ah thillatsate a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huan huang sungnung zaw pen ah a hon pilut a, ngai dih, huang sungnung zaw pen ah dantan nih a na om a; khatpen mallam kongpi chin ah, simlam nga in a om a, khatpen simlam kongpi chin ah mallam nga in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, Hiai dantan simlam nga, a inkem siampute omna ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Dantan mallam nga maitam kem siampute omna ahi; hiaite Zadok tate, Levi tate lak a a nasem ding a Toupa hongnaih sekte ahi uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Huan huangsung a teh a, a dunglam tong za khat, a vailam tong za khat, kimkot ahi; maitam bel intual laitak ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A tempul inlim ah a honpita a, sumtong bangkate a tehchiat a, a langtuak ah tong nga a sah tuaktuak a om a, a lutna tong sawm leh tong li a za ahi; a siktuak a kongpi bangkate tong thum tuaktuak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A sumtong a dunglam tong sawmnih, a vailam tong sawmlehnih ahi a; lut touhna ah kalbi sawm a om a, bangka chin ah a langtuak ah khuam lian a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan biakin ah a hon pilut a, a bangkate a teh a, a sik tuak ah tong guk a sah tuaktuak a om a, huai bel biakbuk vailam chia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan a lutna tong sawm a za ahi a; a sik tuak ah bangkate tong nga tuaktuak ahi; huan asung a dung tong sawmli, a vai tong sawmnih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dantan sungnung ah a lut a, a lutna bangkate tong nih a sah tuaktuak ahi a; a lutna tong guk a za ahi a; a lutna bangkate tong sagih tuaktuak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dantan sungnung a teh a, a sungpi ban ah a dunglam tong sawmnih ahi a: a vailam leng tong sawmnih ahi. Huan ka kiang ah, hiai Mun Siangthou pen ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan a Inpi bang a teh a, tong guk a sah ahi; huan a sik chih ah dantan tong li a za chiat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan chial thumte ah pang dantante a om ua, huchi a huailai a letkipna a neihtheih louhna ding un, inn lam bang a letkipna neilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a pang dantante a hong san hiaihiai in a za semsem a; a bangte a zuih touh ziak in, a kimvel in a sungpi a naih hulhul hi. Huchi in dantan nuainung pen a kipan a tungnungpen pha a pai ding in a lai a kantan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Inpi kim ah suanglep vum om in ka mu a; pang dantan suangphum tehna chiang, tong guk hial a sau tan a sang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pang dantan pawlam bang tong nga a sah ahi; pang dantan pawlam bang ban ah tong nga a awl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inpi suanglep vum leh huangsung dantante kikal a kim in tong sawmnih a za ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pang dantan kongkhakte mun awl lam a hon ahi a, khat ngial in nga ahi, khat simlam a nga ahi: a kim a mun ong tong nga a za ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan tumlam a Inpi phaitam mun ong ban ah inn tong sawmsagih a za ahi; huai inn bang a kim in tong nga a sahvek ahi a, a dung tong sawmkua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan Inpi a teh in tong za a sau ahi; Inpi phaitam mun ong leh huai inn bang sahdan sim tel in tong za ahi nawn hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inn kongtual munawng tong za a sau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan Inn phaitam munawng khen a inn dunglam a teh a, a pang tuak a bangte huap in tong za ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan a sungpite, mun siangthoupente, pawlam sumtongte singpek in a thuap ua; a thum un a kimvel in hon theihlouh tohlet leh inchial a nei a; a inpi lutna kongpi tan in a pialkhang a kipan a tohlet pha a a pum a singpek a thuap ahi, tohlet leng thuap ahi lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kongpi lu tungte, dantan siangthoupente leh a pawlam toh, bang tengteng a sunglam leh a pawlam tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaite Cherub limte leh tumsing limte a zep ahi a, Cherub leh Cherub kikal ah tumsing a om zel a; Cherubte’n mai nih a neichiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing mel bang in langkhat a tumsing lam a nga a, humpinelkai tuailai mel bang in langkhat a tumsing lam a nga nawn hi. Hiaite inn kimvel vek in a gelh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pialkhang a kipan in kongpi tung pha in Cherub leh tumsing lim a zepvek ahi; Inpi bang bel huchi vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sungpi kongpi biang khuamte bel a sah a zat kibang ahi. Mun Siangthoupen ma ah sing a bawl maitam bangtak a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tong thum a sang, tong nih a za, a ningte, a tawte leh a pangte sing a bawlvek ahi. Huan aman ka kiang ah, "Hiai Toupa ma a dohkan ahi," a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sungpi leh Mun Siangthoupen in kongkhak nih tuaktuak a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kongkhak in phel nih a nei tuaktuak a; a phel khat bel kheptheih chiat ahi; kongkhak khat ah phel nih, a dang ah phel nih a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bang a a gelh mah bang un sungpi kongkhakte ah Cherub leh tumsing lim a gelh chiat lai ua; sumtong pua ah singpek sah mahmah a phalh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan sumtong bang langtuakte leh singpek phalhte ah tohlet hon theihlouh leh tumsing lim a omlai a; a Inpi pang dantan leh sing pek phalh leng huchibang mah ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan huang sungnungzaw malam pang ah a hon pikhia a; mun ong zawn mallam kulh khuam doh dantan ah a hon pilut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mallampang a dantante tong za a sau tong sawmnga a za ahi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huang sungnung zaw pen mun ong tong sawmnih lamnga leh huang pawnung zaw suanglep lamdoh inchial thum a om tuaktuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dantante kikal ah tong sawm a za, tong za a sau paisuakna a om a, a kongkhakte’n mallam a nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dantan tungnungte a kawchik zaw a; inchial nuainung zaw leh a laitate sang in a inchialte’n mun lian a luahzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chial thum a lam ahi a, huangsung khuamte bang in khuam a nei ngal kei a; huchi in a laita sang in a tungnungpen a kawchik a, a laita leng a nuainung pen sang in a kawchikzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan dantan pang pawlam ah huangsung pawnung zaw pen lamdoh bang tong sawmnga a sau a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huang sung pawnung zaw a dantante tong sawmnga a sau ahi ua: Inpi zul a pen tong za a sau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan huai dantante nuai ah suahlam pang ah huangsung pawnung zaw a kipan a lutna a om a, pawlam bang kiban sapna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simlam ah leng mun ong zawn a kulh bang doh in dantante a om nawn hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ma a paina leng mallam dantante paina mah bang ahi a: a dung leh a vai leng, a pawtkhiaknate, a lepkhawm dante, a kongkhakte’n simlam a nga chih kia loungal kibang vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai dantante lutna ding paisuakna tawp suahlam bangchi’n ah kongkhak a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Simlam leh mallam dantan, mun awl hondohte dantan siangthoute ahi ua; thil siangthoute a koihkhawm ua; nekding latnate, khelh ziak a kithoihnate, mawh ziak a kithoihnate a latna ding uh ahi: a mun bel Mun Siangthou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huailai a siampute a lut phot uleh, Mun Siangthou a kipan in huangsung pawnung zaw ah a pawtkhe ding uh ahi kei; huai ah a nasepna puansilhte uh a koih zawding ua, puansilh siangthou ahi ngal ua; puansilh dang silh kia in vantang lak ah a gamtang thei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inpi sungnungzaw pen a teh khit in suahlam nga kongpi ah a hon pikhia a, a kimvel in a teh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tehna chiang in suahlam pang a teh a, tong za nga ahi a; a tehna chiang a teh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mallampang a honteh nawn leuleu a, tong za nga ahi a, a tehna chiang a teh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Simlampang a teh nawn a, tehna chiang a teh in tong za nga mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan tumlam a hon teh nawn a, a tehna chiang a teh in tong za nga mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pang li in a tehta a: a dunglam tong za nga, a vailam tong za nga ahi; a kim in kulhbang nei ahi a; huai mun siang leh siang lou deidanna ding a bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in kongpi ah, suahlam kongpi ah a honpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai dih, Israel Pathian thupina suahlam a kipan in a hongtung a; a husa tui tampi ging bang a hi a, lei a thupina in a tanvak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kilakna ka muh a a latdan, khopi hihse ding a a hongpai leh Kebar luigei a kilakna ka muh bangmah ahi a; huchi in, khupboh in ka pukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suahlam nga kongpi ah a Inpi sung ah Toupa thupina a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kha in a hon domkang a, huang sungnungzaw ah a hon pilut a; huan, ngai in, Toupa thupina in a inn a dimvekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan mi khat ka kiang a a dinlai in mi kuahiam hon houpih in ka za a, ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing tapa, hiai ka mangtutphah omna mun, ka khepek ngakna, Israel tate lak a tangtawn a ka tenna ding mun ahi: ka min siangthou Israel Inkawte’n amau in hiam, a kumpipate uh hiam, a hukna uleh a kumpipate uh luangvuina a zang in a hih thanghuai nawnta kei ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kongpi uh ka kongpi chin mahmah a bawl in, a kongpi biang uh ka kongpi biang zul a koih in amau leh keimah kikal ah bang kia omsak in a thilhih kihhuaite un ka min siangthou a hih thanghuai uhi; huaiziak in ka hehna in amau ka hihmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu a kipan in huknate, a kumpipa uh luangte kei a kipan a gamlapi ah koihmang le uh; huchi in a lak uah tangtawn in ka teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang mihing tapa, a Inpi lim uh Israel Inkawte kiang ah ensak in; a thil hihkhelh uh a zumpih theihna ding un, a bawldan ding leng na teh uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan a thilhih tengteng uh a zumpih ua a Inpi omdante, a pawtkhiaknate, a lutnate, a geldante, a zatdante, a kepdante ensak inla, a mitmuh mahmah uah gelh in; a dan pumpi leh a zatdan tengteng a vom ua, a zuih theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai a Inpi adia dan ding ahi: tang vum tungtam kim tengteng mun siangthoupen ding ahi; ngai dih, hiai Inpi adia dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan tong a teh in hiai maitam letlam ahi, tong khat chih tong khat leh khutpek tuam ahi, a kingakna tong khat a sang, tong khat a za, a gei a kim a khap khat a pawng zel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan maitam sanlam hichibang ahi: lei a a kingakna a kipan a dohdan nuainungzaw pen tong nih ahi a, a zatlam tong khat; a dohdan neuzaw pen a kipan a a dohdan lianzaw pen tong li ahi a, tong khat a za ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A maitam tungtam tong li a sang ahi nawn a, maitam tungtam a kipan in ki li ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maitam tungtam a dung leh a vai tong sawmlehnih tuaktuak ahi; a dung a vai kikim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dohdan a dung leh a vai tong sawmlehli tuaktuak ahi; a dung a vai kikim ahi: a gei tong kimkhat ahi: a kingakna a kim in tong khat ahi; a kalbi in suahlam a ngat ding ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: A bawl khit chiang ua maitam zatdan ding hichibang ahi: Halmang kithoihna dingte, sisan thehna dingte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Levi chi siampu Zadok suan a mi, n’on sepsak ding a honnaih sekpa kiang ah khelh ziak a kithoihna ding in bawngpa tuai na piak ding ahi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sisan na la dia, maitam ki lite leh a dohdan ning lite, a gei kimvel in na luan ding a; huchibang in maitam na hihsiang in na siangsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khelh ziak a kithoihna bawngpa tuai na la ding a, Mun Siangthou pawlam a, huai ding a inn a seh ua hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan a ni nihna in keltal, dem bei, khelh ziak a kithoihna ding a lat ding ahi; huchi in maitam bel bawngpa tuai a a hihsiang mah bang un na siangsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maitam hihsiangpen na hih khit chiang un bawngpa tuai gensiat bei leh belamtal, gensiat bei, a hon lak a na lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa ma ah na lan ding a, siampu in chi a soh ding a, Toupa kiang ah haltum ading in a lan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sagih sung ni teng khelh ziak a kithoihna ding in keltal na zang ding ahi; bawngpa tuai leh belamtal, a hon lak a, gensiat bei leng a zat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maitam hihsiang leh siansakna in ni sagih a la ding a; huchi in maitam siangthou ahita ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan huai nite a hih tangtun khit chiang un, a ni giat ni a kipan in siampute’n na haltum kithoihnate uh leh lemna kithoihnate a maitam uah a lan ding ua, huan k’on na sang ding chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Mun Siangthou kongpi pawnung zaw, suahlam a nga ah a honpi kiknawn a, kong khaksa a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, hiai kongpi a kikhak gige ding a, a kihong kei ding a, kuamah a lut sam kei ding uhi; Toupa , Israel Pathian a honglut khit ziak in; a kikhak gige ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi bel Toupa ma a an ne ding in huai ah a tu phet ding; sumtong kongkhak ah a lut ding a, huai mah ah a pawtnawn ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan mallam nga kongpi ah Inpi intual ah a honpi a; ka en a ngai dih, Toupa inn Toupa thupina in a dimvek a; huchi in khupboh in ka pukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, Mihing tapa, Toupa in zatdan leh a dan tengteng na kiang a ka gen tungtang ah na bildoh inla, na mitsuan inla, na lungsim ah chiamteh hoih dih: a Inpi lut dante, a Mun Siangthou a kipan pawtdante, na lungsim ah hoihtak in chiamteh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan helhat, Israel inkawte ngei kiang ah huchi in na gen ding ahi: Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Aw, nou Israel inkawte aw, na kihhuaina tengteng uh behlap ding a pautuam mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungtang leh sa zeksum louh, ka tanghoute, thaute na lat lai ua ka Mun Siangthou, ka inn mahmah hihbuah ding a na pilut ua, ka thukhun a na tatlek uh, na kihhuaina tengtengte uh na tawpta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thil siangthoute nou na kem kei ua, hiai pautuam mite ka Mun Siangthou ah nou sik a kemmi in na sepzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Pautuam mi kuamah, lungtang leh sa zeksumlouh, Israel tate lak a pautuam mi ka Mun Siangthou ah a lut ding uh a hi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levi chi, Israelte milim delh a a vakmang lai ua kei a kipan a gamlapi a paisate’n bel a thulimlouhna uh a paw ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka Mun Siangthou ah nasemmi in a pang ding ua; Inpi kongkhakte a ngak ding ua; Inpi sung ah na a sem ding uh: haltum kithoihnate, mipi adia kithoihnate a gou ding ua; mipi na sepsak ding in a ma uah ading ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A milimte uh ma ah a na uh a sepsak ding ua; Israelte Inkawte adin thulimlouhna a pukna a hihnak ziak un a tung uah ka khut ka lik ding a; a thulimlouhna uh a paw ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in ka kiang ah siampu nasem ding in a honnaih ngeikei ding ua; ka thil siangthoute, thil siangthoupente a honnaih ngei sam kei ding uh; a zahlakna uleh a thil kihhuai hih sate uh a paw zaw ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A Inpi kemmite ding in ka bawl ding a, nasepna tengteng leh hih ding om peuhmahte hih ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siampu Levi chi, Zadok ta, kei a kipan a Israel tate a vakmanglai ua ka Mun Siangthou kemmite’n bel ka nasem ding in a hongnaih ding uh; thau leh sisan lan ding in ka ma ah ading ding uh, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka Mun Siangthou ah a lut ding ua, nna hon sepsak ding in ka dohkan a honnaih ding ua, kei hon kemmi in a pang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, huang sungnungzaw kongpite a a lut un puanaktual malngat in a kithuam ding ua, huang sungnungzaw leh inn sunglam a na a sep sung un samul puan a silh ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dial malngat a khim ding ua, puanmalngat pheitom a bun ding ua, kho-ul sak thei a silh ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan huangsung pawnung zaw, vantang kiang a a hong pawtkhiak uleh a nasepna puansilhte uh a suah ding ua, dantan siangthou ah a koih ding uh, puansilh dang a silh ding uh; mipite a puansilh ua misiangthou a a bawl tei louhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lute uh a metgiau ding uh ahi kei a; a sam uh leng a hawisau ding uh ahi sam kei; a met lel ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siampu peuhpeuh huang sungnung zaw pen a lut chiang un uain a dawn ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meithai hiam maksa nung hiam zi in a nei ding uh ahi sam kei hi; Israel Inkawte, nungak siangthou hiam siampu sihsan meithai a kitenpih zawk ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mite thil siangthou leh siangthoulou kibatlouhdan a hilh ding uh ahi; thil siang leh siang lou a khentuam sak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thubuaite leng a ngaihtuah ding uh ahi; ka ngaihtuah bangzel in a ngaihtuah ding uh: Ka Ankuanglui sehsa tengteng ah ka dante leh ka dan bawlsate a zuih ding uh ahi; ka khawlnite leng a tan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau kihihbuah ding in misi luang a naih ding uh ahi kei; himahleh nu hiam, pa hiam, tanu hiam, tapa hiam unaupa hiam sanggamnu pasal neilou hiam adin a kihihbuah thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan a kisiansak nung in amah ading in ni sagih simsak nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huang sungnungzaw Mun Siangthou a nasem ding a a lut ni’n khelh ziak a kithoihna amah ading in a lan ding, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Goutan bangmah a neikei ding ua; a goutan uh kei ka hi ding. Israel ah tan bangmah na pe ding uh ahi kei, a tan uh keimah ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nekding latte, khelh ziak a thillatte, mawh ziak a thillatte a ne ding ua; Israel lak a thil siangthou peuhmah amau ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gah masate lak a a hoihpente, na thillat chiteng ua a hoihpen, na thillat tengteng ua siampute ading ahi: na inn ua vualzawlna a tamden theihna ding in tangbuang meklom hoihpen siampu kiang ah na pe ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siampute’n sapul a neklouh ding uh ahi. Vasa hiam gamsa hiam khut thuak hiam, amah sih a si hiam a nekding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailou in leng goutan ding a gam na hawm hun chiang un gamseh siangthou, Toupa kiang ah thilpiak na bawl ding uhi: A dunglam tong sing nih leh sang nga, a vai lam tong sing nih, a pum in gam siangthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai ah Mun Siangthou adin a dung leh a vai tong za nga tuaktuak, kimkot ahi ding a, a kim in tong za nga a za mun ong a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan hiai tehsa a kipan in a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga leh a vai tong sing khat na tehkhe ding a, huai ah Mun Siangthou pen a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamseh siangthou bel, siampu, Mun Siangthou a nasemmi, a nasem ding a Toupa naih semmite ding ahi ding a, a inn mun ding un leh Mun Siangthou ding in gam siangthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mun dang a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga, a vai tong sing khat, Levi chi Inpi a nasemmite tuam ding in, a tenna khopi ding in a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamseh siangthou latsa zul ah khopi tan a vai tong za nga leh a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga na sep ding uhi, Israel Inkaw pumpi ading ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, kumpitapa tan bel gam siangthou latsa leh khopi tan malam ah tumlam a tumlam nga in, suahlam a suahlam nga in a om ding ahi. A dung bel tumlam gamgi a kipan a suahlam gamgi pha in, gamseh dang tanmah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai bel Israel gam a amah tantuam ahi ding ahi: ka vaihawmte’n ka mite a nuaisiah nawn kei ding ua, Israel Inkawte a nam tuamdan bangzel in gam a pe zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Aw, Israel vaihawmte aw, hunta hen, hiamgamna leh kigapna tawpsanta unla; diktattak a vaihawm leh diktak a hih chingta unla, ka mite delhkhiak nak pen tawpta un, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bukna dik, ephah dik leh bath dik na zat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephah leh bath a kikim ding uh ahi, bath homer seh sawm a khen a seh khat ahi ding a, ephah leng homer seh sawm a khen a seh khat ahi sam ding: homer a kipan a tehkhiak ding ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan sekel bel gerah sawmnih ahi ding a: sekel nga bel sekel nga geih ahi ding a, sekel sawm bel sekel sawm geih ahi ding a, na min a uh sekel sawmnga geih ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan hiai thillat na lat ding uh ahi ding; buh homer khat zel ah ephah seh guk a khen a seh khat leh buh man homer khat zel ah ephah seh guk a khen a seh khat na pe ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan sathau latdan ding kor khat zel ah bath seh sawm a khen a seh khat; kor bel bath sawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel gantatna mun hoih a kipan belamhon lak a za nih zel ah a nou khat, nekding lat ding in, haltum kithoihna ding in lemna thillat ding in amaute hihsiangna bawlna ding in a lat ding uh ahi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gam a mi tengteng in Israel vaihawmpa kiang ah hiai thillat a pe ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ankuang luina ah, kha thak ah, khawlni ah, Israel Ankuanglui ni sehsa tengteng ah haltum kithoihna, nekding lat, dawn ding latte lan in a ngaihtuah ding a; khelh ziak a kithoihna, nekding lat, haltum kithoihna, lemna thillat Israel Inkawte kisiansakna ding in aman a tumsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Kha khatna, huai kha ni khat ni’n bawngtal tuai gensiat beina zang ding a, Mun Siangthou na siangsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan siampu in khelh ziak a kithoihna sisan a la ding a, Inpi kongpi biang leh maitam dohdan ning lite leh huang sungnung zaw pen kongpi bangka ah a tat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai kha ni sagih ni’n hihkhak hiam theihlouh ziak hiam a thil hihkhial mite ading in leng huchi mah bang in na hih ding a, huchibang in Inpi hihsianna na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kha khatna, huai kha ni sawmlehli ni’n Paikan Ankuang na tang ding ua; huan, ni sagih sung tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai nin vaihawmpa in amah leh a gam a mi tengteng adia khelh ziak a kithoihna dia bawngtal tuai a tum ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ankuanglui hun ni sagih sung teng in bawngtal tuai gensiat bei sagih leh belamtal sagih zel Toupa adin haltum kithoihna ding in a tum ding, khelh ziak a kithoihna ding in niteng in keltal khat toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan tanghou lat ding in bawngtal khat zel ah ephah khat, belamtal khat zel ah ephah khat leh ephah khat zel ah sathau hin khat a tum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kha sagihna, huai kha ni sawm leh ni nga ni a Ankuangluina ah ni sagih sung huchibang mah in a hih ding a, khelh ziak a kithoihnate, haltum kithoihnate, tanghou latte leh sathau latte a tum ding ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Huang sungnung zaw pen kongpi suahlam nga pen nasep ni, ni guk sung a kikhak ding a, khawlni leh kha thak ni’n a kihong ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan vaihawmpa bel kongpi sumtong ah a lut ding a, kongpi bangka chin ah ading ding a, siampute’n a haltum kithoih leh lemna thillatte a bawlsak ding ua, lutna kongpi dantan ah Pathian a be ding; huchi in a pawtkhe ding a, kong bel nitaklam tan a khaklouh ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan vantang in bel khawlni leh kha thakte ah kongpi lutna chinte ah Toupa ma ah Pathian a be ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawlni’n vaihawmpa’n Toupa kiang a haltum kithoihna a lat ding bel belamnou gensiat bei guk leh belamtal gensiat bei khat ahi ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Belamtal khat zel ah tanghou lat ephah khat, belamnou pen ah bel a piak theih bangbang, leh ephah khat ah sathau hin khat zel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kha thak ni’n bawngtal tuai gensiat bei khat, belamnou guk leh belamtal khat ahi ding a, gensiat bei ahihvek ding uh ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan tanghou lat a bawl ding a, bawngtaltuai ah ephah khat, belamtal ah ephah khat, belamnou pen ah a theih bangbang, leh ephah khat zel ah sathau hin khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaihawmpa a lut in kongpi sumtong ah a lut ding a, huai mah ah a pawtkhe nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vantangte bel Ankuanglui ni sehsa a Toupa ma a a hongpai uleh Pathian be ding a mallam kongpi a honglut simlam kongpi ah a pawtkhe ding uh; simlam kongpi a honglut mallam kongpi ah a pawt khe leuleu ding uh; a lutna kongpi uah a kik ding uh ahi kei a, a malam ah a paizaw ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan a lut un vaihawmpa bel a lak uah a lut ding a, a pawt un a pawtkhe nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nopbawlna leh sehsa Ankuanglui nite, tanghou lat bawngtal tuai khat ah ephah khat, belamtal khat ah ephah khat, belamnou pen ah a piak theih bangbang, ephah khat ah sathau hin khat zel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan vaihawmpa’n utthu a thillat a lat dek leh haltum kithoihna hiam lemna thillat hiam Toupa kiang a utthu a a thillat bang a a lat dek leh suahlam nga kong a honsak ding a, khawlni a hih bangmah in, haltum kithoihnate leh lemna thillatte a bawl ding: huchi in a pawtkhe ding a, a pawtkhiak nung in kong a khak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Niteng a Toupa kiang a haltum kithoihna ding in belamnou kum khat a upa, gensiat bei na zang ding a, zingsang in na zat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingsang teng in tanghou lat na bawl ding a, ephah seh guk a khen seh khat leh sathau hin khat seh thum a khen seh khat tangbuang nel mahmah nawmsakna din: huai bel tangtawn a Toupa kiang a tanghou latdan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichibang in haltum thillat gige ding in belamnou, tanghou latte, sathaute zingsang teng in na bawl ding ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: vaihawmpa in a tapate, kua kiang ah leng, goutan bangpeuh a piak leh a tapate a ahi ding a, a gou uh luah a himai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh a goutan a pen a nasemmi kuahiam kiang a a piak leh salpawtna kum tan in a nei ding a, huai ah vaihawmpa kiang ah a pekik nawn ding hi. Amah gou ngeingei bel a tapate ading ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huailou in vaihawmpa in mite goutan a suhsak ding ahi kei a, a inn leh lou ua kipan a delhkhe ding ahi sam kei; amah a pen mah a tapate kiang ah goutan in a pedia; Amau inn leh lou a kipan mite a vakzak louhna ding un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan kongpi pang a siampute adia dantan siangthou mallam nga ah a hon pilut a; ngai dih, a phaitam tumlam pang ah mun a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Hiai siampute’n mawh ziak a thillat leh khelh ziak a thillat a huanna mun uh, tanghou lat omna mun ahi; huangsung pawnung zaw a a tawikhiak ua mite hihsiangna dia a bawllouhna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huang pawnung zaw ah a hon pikhia a, huangsung ningzul ah a hon paisak a; ngai dih, a huangsung ning chiat ah huang a om nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huangsung ning li ah huang, bang nei, a dung tong sawmli, a vai tong sawmthum a na om a; huai a ning a te a li un a kikim vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai mun li sunglam ah a kimvel in suang vualin a lem ua, huai vual nuai ah a kim in huanna ding thuk a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in ka kiang ah, “Hiaite huanna in, Inpi nasemmite’n mite kithoihna sa a huanna dingte uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Inpi kongkhak ah a hon pikik a; ngai dih, Inpi kongpi chin nuai a kipan, suahlam nga in tui a hong luangkhia a; Inpi suahlam nga ahi a, huan tui maitam simlam Inpi pang taklam nuai a kipan in a hong luangkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan mallam nga kongpi ah a hon pikhia a, inkuan ah suahlam nga kongpi pawnung zaw pha in a honpi a; ngai dih, taklam pang ah tui a hong luangkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan huai mi’n tehna khau tawi in suahlam nga a pai in tong sang khat a teh a; tui a honngap galkah sak a, siakmit tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in tong sang khat a teh nawn a; tui a hon ngap galkah sak nawn a, khuk tan ahi. Huan, tong sang khat a teh nawn a; hon ngap galkah sak nawn a, tui kawng tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan tong sang khat a teh nawn a; ngah galkah vuallouh luipi a hong hita a; tui a hong sangzel a, a ngah a ngah galkah vuallouh, a leuh a leuh tham luipi a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kiang ah, “Mihing tapa, hiai na mu hia?” a chi hi. Huan luigei a kiknawn ding in a honpi kikta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in ka kik a, ngai dih, luigei tawn in, luigei langtuak in sing tampi a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Hiai tui suahlam gam lam a luang Arabah gam a luanglut ding ahi; tuipi ah a luanglut ding a, tuipi tui al tui siangthou a suaksak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan hichi a honghi ding a; luite a luanna peuh uah ganhing chiteng in a damloh ding ua, ngasate a om huthut ding uh: tuipi tui a siangthouna ding leh a luanna peuh a ganhingte’n a hinlohna ding un hiai lui hongluang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan hichi a honghi ding a; a gei ah ngamanmite a ding ding ua; Engedi a kipan Eneglaim pha in lenpaihna mun ahi ding; a ngasa pen a chi bangzel un, tuipi lian ngasa bang mai in a tam mahmah ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Buannawi leh chiklakte bel a siangthou teikei ding ua, chi khuk ding a nutsiat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A luigei ah a gei langnih in theikung chichih a pou ding a, huaite a nah a vuai ngeikei in a gahlou ngei sam kei ding, Mun Siangthou a kipan a lui hong luangkhia vak a hih ziak in kha chih in a gah ding: a gah nekding ahi ding a, a nah bel hihdamna ding ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ahi: Hiai Israel nam sawmlehnih lak a gam kihawmdan ding ahi hi: Joseph in tan nih a tang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kibang chiat in na tang ding uh ahi; na pipute uh kiang a piak ding a ka kichiamsa ahi: hiai gam na gam tan un a puk ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai a gam pumpi gi ding ahi: Mallam ah Tuipi Lian a kipan in Hethlon paisuak in Hamath lutna guam ah Zedad a tung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Berothah, Damaska leh Hamath kigitna lai a om Sibraim, Hauran gamgi zul a om Hazorhattikon pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in gamgi bel Tuipi Lian a kipan in Damaska gamgi zul a Hazarenan pha in ahi ding a: mallam ah Hamath gamgi ahi ding hi. Hiai mallam gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan suahlam ah Hauran leh Damaska kikal ah Gilead leh Israel gam kikal a Jordan lui dung a zui ding; mallam gamgi a kipan in suahlam tuipi ah Tamar a pha ding. Hiai suahlam gamgi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simlam ah Tamar a kipan in Meibothkadesh tuite pha in Aigupta lui zui in Tuipi Lian a tung ding. Hiai simlam gamgi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tumlam ah Tuipi Lian in a gi ding a, simlam gamgi a kipan in Hamath lutna guam zawn pha in. Hiai tumlam gamgi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in hiai gam Israel nam dungzui in na lak uah na hawm ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi ding a, na gam tan ding uleh na lak ua namdang teng, zi leh ta nei sate gam tan ding bel na hop ding uh ahi. Amau lah Israel ta dia piang mawng ahi ding uh ahi; Israel namte lak ah noute bang in tan a neih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan hichi a honghi ding a; kua nam lak ah leng namdang na nateng leh, huailai a a gam tan ding na sehsak ding uh ahi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiaite a nam minte uh ahi: Mallam gamgi Tuipi Lian a kipan a Hethlon paisuak in Hamath lutna guam ah Damaska gamgi a Hamath kiang mallam pang Hazarenan pha in, suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Dante tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dante tan toh a kigi in suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Asherte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asherte tan toh a kigi in suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Naphtalite tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naphtalite tan toh a kigi in suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Manassehte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Manassehte tan toh a kigi in suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Ephraimte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ephraimte tan toh a kigi in suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Reubente tan ahi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Reubente tan toh a kigi in suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Judahte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judahte tan toh ki gamgi in suahlam leh tumlam ah, thilpiak na lat ding uh a vai tong sing nih leh sang nga ahi ding a; a dung suahlam leh tumlam sang ah tan dang bangmah in ahi a, a lai a Mun Siangthou om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thilpiak Toupa kiang a na lat ding uh a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga, a vai tong sing nih ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan hiai ah siampute adin gam siangthou thilpiak ding ahi ding a; mallam sang ah a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga leh tumlam sang ah a vai tong sing khat leh suahlam sang ah a vai tong sing khat, simlam sang ah a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga ahi ding ahi: A laizang ah Toupa Mun Siangthou a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siampu siansaksa, Zadok tapate ka thu kemmite ding ahi ding. Huaite Israel tate a vakmang lai ua Levi chite a vakmang sam bang ua vakmang loute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan gam thilpiak pumpi a kipan amau a piaktuam, mun siangthoupen ahi ding a, Levi chi tan toh a kigi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siampu tan zulzul ah Levi chite’n tan a nei ding ua, a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga, a vai tong sing khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan a zuak ding uh ahi kei a, a khen ding uh leng ahi sam kei: a gam hoihna tata leng midang kiang a piak ding ahi kei hi: Toupa adia siangthou ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan a vai tong sing nih leh sang nga ban ah tong sang nga vantang tan, khopi dinna ding, tenna inn dingte leh khopuate a ding ahi ding: khopi bel a laizang ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in a teh vialdan hichibang in ahi ding: A mallampang tong sang li leh za nga, a simlam pang tong sang li leh za nga; a suahlam pang tong sang li leh za nga, a tumlam pang tong sang li leh za nga ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khopi in khopua a nei ding a; mallam pang in tong za nih leh sawmnga; simlam pang tong za nih leh sawmnga, suahlam pang tong za nih leh sawmnga, tumlam pang tong za nih leh sawmnga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dunglam val lai thilpiak siangthou zul a pen suahlam ah tong sing khat, tumlam ah tong sing khat ahi ding: thilpiak siangthousa zulzul ahi ding hi: huai a thilpawtte khopi a nasemmite nekding ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in, khopi a nasemmi Israel nam tengteng a mite’n a lei a let ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thilpiak pumpi a dung tong sing nih leh sang nga, a vai tong sing nih leh sang nga ahi ding; thilpiak siangthousa, dung leh vai kikim khopi tan toh na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A val thilpiaksa siangthou leh khopi tan pang lang tuaktuak vaihawmpa tan ahi ding a, suahlam sang ah thilpiak tong sing nih leh sang nga ban, gamseh dangte zulzul vaihawmpa tan ahi ding: huchi in thilpiak siangthousa leh Inpi Mun Siangthou bel a laizang ah a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan Levi chi tan leh khopi tan vaihawmpa tante kikal ah a om ding a; vaihawmpa tan Judah tan leh Benjamin tan toh a kigi ding. Namdangte gam ding
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan nam omlaite tungthu ah, suah leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Benjaminte tan ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjaminte tan toh kigi in suah leh tumlam sang ah tan khat Simeonte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeonte tan toh kigi in suah leh tumlam sang Issakarte tan ahi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Issakarte tan toh kigi in suah leh tumlam sang tankhat Zebulunte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zebulunte tan toh kigi in suah leh tumlam sang tan khat Gadte tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gadte tan simlam pang gamgi Tarmar a kipan in Meribah Kadesh tuite tan in Aigupta lui zui in Tuipi Lian a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hiai Israel namte goutan ding a gam kihawmdan ding leh a gam sehtuamte ahi uh chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan hiaite khopi a kipan pawtnate ahi uh; mallam pang tong sang li leh za nga ah kongpi thum:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khopi kongpite Israel nam min bangzel a sak ding ahi a; Mallam kongpi thumte, Reuben kongpi khat, Judah kongpi khat, Levi kongpi khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Suahlam pang tong sang li leh za nga ah kongpi thum: Joseph kongpi khat, Benjamin kongpi khat, Dan kongpi khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Simlam pang tong sang li leh za nga ah kongpi thum: Simeon kongpi khat, Issakar kongpi khat, Zebulun kongpi khat ahi ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tumlam pang tong sang li leh za nga ah kongpi thum: Gad kongpi khat, Asher kongpi khat, Naphtali kongpi khat, ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A kimvel in tong sing khat leh sang giat ahi ding a; huai ni a kipan in khopi min bel, ‘ Toupa omna mun’ chih ahi ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
